<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">NGE - Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ngelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu che Zingelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngelo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ngel</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu che</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ngelo</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu che zingelo ni mdunganyo wa milosi ya mizungu. Wawandisi wengi wagela mikono mwo uwandisi we zingelo izi, mna seuta Selemani, mwana seuta Daudi, niye awandikise ngelo zinyingi mwe izi. Mwe kitabu che nk'hongo cha maseuta mnango wa kane na msitali wa milongo mitatu na miidi, yalongwa kugamba awandikaga ngelo alufu nt'hatu. Seuta Selemani amanyikisaga kwe mizungu yakwe andaga nayo. Ivo hant'hu hengi mwe kitabu che zingelo chawandikwagwa umwo Selemani andaga akei mgima, mwe kaline ya mlongo umwo Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa. Hant'hu hatuhu hasigale mwe kitabu iki vadahika hawandikwagwa na kuduganywa mwo lupisi aho hzekiaandaga kaikaila Yuda mwo mhilimo wa magana mfungate na mlongo na shano kubula magana mtandatu milongo mnane na mtandatu, aho kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa (mwe milongo miidi na mishano msitali wa nk'hongo). Ngelo ni milosi ya mizungu naho ni ya kindedi, mna ivituhu kujink'ha lagano hegu ulotezi. Enga viya mwe milongo miidi na kaidi na msitali wa kaidi ikulonga kugamba, wana wakuleligwa mwe sila yedi watimila sila iyo wakeza kunda wakulu. Ngelo ino kwavovose hiyo lagano kugamba hokunde na chochose nekiiihe mwo wikazi wa wana awo waleligwe mwe sila iyedi. Hata ivo ni ulangilizi wedi ukimale mwe kindedi. Kitabu che zingelo chenye chalonga kwa kutaila, mwo mnango wa nk'hongo na msitali wa kaidi kubula wa mtandatu. Kitalo chakwe ni kuwambiza kwa uhufu wabwanga nawo wamanye mzungu no ulangilizi wedi, naho wata mzungu wandilise na mzungu .</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani:</para>
  <para style="io">1. Milango ya nk'hongo kubula milongo ni Zingelo za Selemani 22:16</para>
  <para style="io">2. Miduganyo miidi ya milosi ya mzungu 22:17-24</para>
  <para style="io">3. Miduganyo mituhu ya ngelo. Izi zaduganywagwa ni wandima wa seuta Hezekia.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Milosi ya Aguli, Mnango wa 30</para>
  <para style="io">5. Milosi ya Lemueli. Mnango 31:1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">6. Kwo uhelo, kwalongwa mbuli ya nyendo zedi za wakaza want'hu: 31:10-31.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PRO 1" />
  <para style="s">Wambizi we Zingelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 1:1" />Ngelo izi za Sulemani mwana kilume ywa Daudi seuta ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PRO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 1:2" />Ngelo izi zawenk'haga want'hu mzungu na wogohi, naho zawatenda wamanye mbuli zedi. <verse eid="PRO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 1:3" />Ngelo izi zawatenda kunda mzungu na ukindedi na kudamanya yakwelela. <verse eid="PRO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 1:4" />Zawenk'ha umanyi wadya heweina ubala, wabwanga nawo, wapata umanyi vileke wekale kwa wengele. <verse eid="PRO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 1:5" />Mta mzungu ategeleze na kongezela umanyi wakwe, na mta ubala apate ulangilizi, <verse eid="PRO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 1:6" />Mnt'hu amanye mbuli ze mizungu ne miliganyizo na mbuli za wata umanyi na ngelo.<verse eid="PRO 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa wabwanga na wandele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 1:7" />Kumvika Zumbe Mnungu ni nk'hongelo ya umanyi, mna wahezi waubela mzungu una ubala.<verse eid="PRO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 1:8" />Mwanangu tegeleza makanyo ya iso, naho use kuleka mahinizo ya nyokwe. <verse eid="PRO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 1:9" />Ayo nayande enga taji ina mahambo mwo mtwi wako, enga mkufu ukuwagila wa mwe singo yako.<verse eid="PRO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 1:10" />Mwanangu unase kuzumila kuluvigwa ni wata wavu naho use kuwazumila. <verse eid="PRO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 1:11" />Wakagamba, “Kite kimnyatile mnt'hu na kumkoma! Kite kikawatowe heweena masa. <verse eid="PRO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 1:12" />Nekiwamele wakanda wagima enga vikuta, wande enga wadya wakuhubugila mwo mnyongomela! <verse eid="PRO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 1:13" />Nekipate ugoli wose wa yombe, nyumba zetu nezimeme vitahigwe! <verse eid="PRO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 1:14" />Soo kinde hamwenga, vose nekipate na nekipangilane.”<verse eid="PRO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 1:15" />Weye mwanangu use kulongozana nawo, kindila kiga chako kisekutimilana nawo. <verse eid="PRO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 1:16" />Kwaviya woho waunga kudamanya wavu, wasunguza kwitila sakame. <verse eid="PRO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 1:17" />Hiyo kint'hu kwinika mtengo uku dege dikakaula, <verse eid="PRO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 1:18" />mna want'hu awa wanyatila na kukegwila woho wenye, wenika mtego wa kukegwila mioyo yawe wenye. <verse eid="PRO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 1:19" />Nivo zili sila kwa wadya wakupata ugoli kwa uhoki, kuhujila kwawe kwawabananga wakwikala kwa uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzungu wetanga want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 1:20" />Mizungu yetangana kwa izwi mwe sila, naho yabwelekeza mwa magwilo, <verse eid="PRO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 1:21" />yetanga mwe midugano mikulu ya want'hu mwe mingiilo, mwo mzi namo yabwelekeza mbuli zakwe.<verse eid="PRO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 1:22" />“Nyuwe wahezi! Nomnde wahezi kubula ini? Wata lubezo nawande na kinyemi mwo lubezo lwawe na wahezi kuuihiya mzungu kubula ini? <verse eid="PRO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 1:23" />Tegelezeni makanyo yangu, neniwenk'heni zifanyanyi zangu, naho neniwalagiseni mbuli zangu. <verse eid="PRO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 1:24" />Kwaviya hiwetangani naho niyo mwalemela kunitegeleza, nehiwachuluilani mkono wangu hawetangani mna hehali aukaule. <verse eid="PRO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 1:25" />Niyo mwabela ulangilizi wose, naho hamzumile makanyo yangu, <verse eid="PRO 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 1:26" />ivo name neniwasekeni mwa makunt'ho yenu, neniwabeleni umwo mkeziilwa ni wogofi, <verse eid="PRO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 1:27" />umwo wogofi ukawabwiilani enga mjubwaniso, makunt'ho yenyu umwo yanaweziilani enga kisingisa, umwo masulumizo na kiyangayanga vikawapata. <verse eid="PRO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 1:28" />Aho naho nomniitange mna miye heniwategeleze, nomnizungule kwa kukombeka mna homnipate. <verse eid="PRO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 1:29" />Kwaviya nomkauihia umanyi, naho walemelaga kumvika Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="PRO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 1:30" />Ivo mwalemelaga kutegeleza ulangilizi wangu, niyo naho mwayabela makanyo yangu yose, <verse eid="PRO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 1:31" />ivo nompate kiya muungigwe mpate naho nomsulumile kwa yadya mkuunga mdamanye. <verse eid="PRO 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 1:32" />Kwaviya wahezi wakekoma kwa kulemela mzungu, heweina mzungu nawabanike kwa kukehuwila woho wenye. <verse eid="PRO 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 1:33" />Mna kila yudya nanitegeleze neekale kwa utondowazi, neekale haheina kogoha yaihile.”<verse eid="PRO 1:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PRO 2" />
  <para style="s">Geleko dya mzungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 2:1" />Mwanangu unazumila mbuli zangu, na kuyatoza malagizo yangu. <verse eid="PRO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 2:2" />Utegelezese vint'hu va mzungu, na kuonyekeza umoyo wako upate ubala. <verse eid="PRO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 2:3" />Ivo itanga wink'higwe mzungu, ulombezese wink'higwe na ubala, <verse eid="PRO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 2:4" />unazungula umanyi enga masawa, na kuizungula enga kindolo kikefisile. <verse eid="PRO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 2:5" />Uneva noudamanye ivo noumanye vo kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, no kummanya Mnungu. <verse eid="PRO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 2:6" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu awenk'ha want'hu mzungu mwe milomo yakwe mwalawa fanyanyi zedi na mzungu. <verse eid="PRO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 2:7" />Awenk'ha wambizi wata miyoyo yedi, naho yehe awamila want'hu wana uhuwilwa. <verse eid="PRO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 2:8" />Ayamila miyoyo ya want'hu wata uwedi, na kuzidima sila za wahuwilwa.<verse eid="PRO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 2:9" />Unanitegeleza noumanye uwedi no uwagilwa, noumanye kuipanga sila yedi na iihile. <verse eid="PRO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 2:10" />Kwaviya umanyi nounde mwo moyo wako, na mzungu nouwagilwe mwo moyo wako. <verse eid="PRO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 2:11" />Mzungu noukwamile, umanyi nawo noukudime vedi. <verse eid="PRO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 2:12" />Nevikuike hale na sila ziihile, na want'hu wakulonga mbuli zi kwazaganya. <verse eid="PRO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 2:13" />Want'hu wakuzileka sila zedi, vileke watimile sila zawe ziihile, <verse eid="PRO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 2:14" />want'hu wakudamanya uwihi na kwelelwa na mbuli zawe zo uwihi, <verse eid="PRO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 2:15" />want'hu awo waganika naho sila zawe hazikuhuilwa.<verse eid="PRO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 2:16" />Mzungu noukutende kukenega na wavele wahabwasi, mvele mhabwasi mta milosi yedi, <verse eid="PRO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 2:17" />mvele akumleka mgosiwe ywo ubwanga wakwe, uyo kajala lagano dyakwe aikaga ha Zumbe Mnungu ywakwe. <verse eid="PRO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 2:18" />Nyumba yakwe zalongoza want'hu kwo kubanika, sila zakwe nazo zawegala kwe isi ya wabanike. <verse eid="PRO 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 2:19" />Yeyose naamtimile mvele uyo haauye naho, sila yo ugima wakwe nayo heiuye. <verse eid="PRO 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 2:20" />Kwaivo waungigwa kutimila mliganyizo wa want'hu wedi na kutimila migendele ya want'hu wahuwilwa. <verse eid="PRO 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 2:21" />Kwaviya want'hu wedi nawenk'hwe isi, na wahuwilwa nawekalise mwe isi. <verse eid="PRO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 2:22" />Mna waihile nawahauswe mwe isi, na wata finju nawahauswe uumwo.<verse eid="PRO 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PRO 3" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa wabwanga na wandele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 3:1" />Mwanangu use kujala mahinizo yangu, mna ukumbukile malagizo yangu mwo moyo wako. <verse eid="PRO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 3:2" />Kwaviya mahinizo yangu naya kongezele wikazi mtali na upati. <verse eid="PRO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 3:3" />Use kuleka kutimila sigilizi na uhuwilwa uhalawe mwako, uvitozese naho viwandikwe mwo moyo wako. <verse eid="PRO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 3:4" />Unadamanya ivo nouzumilwe na kutunywa ha Zumbe Mnungu na ha want'hu.<verse eid="PRO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 3:5" />Mhuwile Zumbe Mnungu kwa moyo wako wose, use kuhuwila ubala wako mwenye. <verse eid="PRO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 3:6" />Umkumbukile Zumbe Mnungu mwe mbuli zako zose, yehe naye naakwamile mwe zisila zako zose. <verse eid="PRO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 3:7" />Use kukeona mwenye kunda na mzungu kujink'ha ivo wili, weye mwogohe Zumbe Mnungu na kwikala hale no uwihi, <verse eid="PRO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 3:8" />uneva unatenda ivo, noupate ugima mwo mwili wako, na ludole mwa mavuha yako. <verse eid="PRO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 3:9" />Mtunye Zumbe Mnungu kwa ugoli wako, na kwa ulozo wako wa nk'hongo, <verse eid="PRO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 3:10" />unatenda ivo magulu yako nayamemese nk'hande, mabiga yako nayo nayameme divai mp'hya.<verse eid="PRO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 3:11" />Mwanangu use kubela makanyo ya Zumbe Mnungu, naho usekuihia umwo akakufank'hila. <verse eid="PRO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 3:12" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu amkanya yudya akumuunga, enga ivo tate akumfank'hila mwanawe akwelelwa naye. <verse eid="PRO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 3:13" />Ni vedi kwa mnt'hu akubunk'hula umanyi na mnt'hu yudya akupata mzungu, <verse eid="PRO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 3:14" />kwaviya mzungu ni wedi kujink'ha masawa, ina upati kujink'ha zahabu. <verse eid="PRO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 3:15" />Mzungu una yombe kujink'ha maiwe ya yombe, hakihali kikukwelela kikudaha kuligana nacho. <verse eid="PRO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 3:16" />Mwo mkono wakwe wo kulume naakutende wikalise, na kwo mkono wakwe wo kumoso nakwink'he ugoli na nt'hunyo. <verse eid="PRO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 3:17" />Sila zakwe ni zedi, zose ni sila zo utondowazi. <verse eid="PRO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 3:18" />Mzungu ni mti wo ugima kwa wose wakuukumbatila, nawavikilwe wose wakuunga wautoze.<verse eid="PRO 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 3:19" />Zumbe Mnungu aumbaga si kwa sila mzungu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:19">kwa umanyi aikaga ulanga hant'hu hakwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 3:20" />Kombokela mzungu wakwe n'choko yalavaga mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:20">mavunde nayo niyo yadondomosa mnyuzu.<verse eid="PRO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 3:21" />Mwanangu uyatozese ulamuzi mzungu na wengele, usekuzumila vimlawe mwako, <verse eid="PRO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 3:22" />ivo nevikwink'he ugima naho ni mahambo yedi mwe singo yako. <verse eid="PRO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 3:23" />Aho noudahe kugenda vedi, naho kiga chako hekikobadike. <verse eid="PRO 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 3:24" />Umwo ukatambaala howogohe, naho ukagona noupate nt'hongo zina mwiile. <verse eid="PRO 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 3:25" />Unase kogoha umwo unatiswa, hegu makunt'ho kulawa kwa waihi. <verse eid="PRO 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 3:26" />kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu niye naakwamile, naakuhonye sema unagwilwe mwo mtego.<verse eid="PRO 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 3:27" />Use kumnyima wambizi mnt'hu akuunga wambizi, ikanda una udahi wa kudamanya ivo. <verse eid="PRO 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 3:28" />Use kumgamba myawo aite du mpaka luvi, ikanda weye wadaha kumwink'ha icho akuunga dyelo. <verse eid="PRO 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 3:29" />Use kuika mzungu wiihile mwa miyawo, akwikala hagihi na weye uku akakuhuwila weye haheina wogohi. <verse eid="PRO 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 3:30" />Use kugomba na mnt'hu haheina chochose cho kugombela, ikanda hakubanange chochose. <verse eid="PRO 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 3:31" />Usekumuonela finju mnt'hu mta nk'humbizi hegu kutimila migendele yakwe. <verse eid="PRO 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 3:32" />Kwaviya maihi ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mna yehe awatenda wambwiyaze wadya wata moyo wedi. <verse eid="PRO 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 3:33" />Zumbe Mnungu awaligita nyumba za want'hu waihi, mna awavikila want'hu wedi mwo wikazi wawe. <verse eid="PRO 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 3:34" />Yehe awabela wata lubezo, mna awenk'ha uwedi want'hu wakukeseleza. <verse eid="PRO 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 3:35" />Wata mzungu nawapate nt'hunyo, mna wahezi nawaone soni.<verse eid="PRO 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PRO 4" />
  <para style="s">Ulangilizi wa mwelesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 4:1" />Wanangu, mwive ayo akulonga tati yenyu, tegelezeni kwa wengele vileke mpate ubala. <verse eid="PRO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 4:2" />Kwaviya nawenk'hani malagizo yedi, msekujala mahinizo yangu. <verse eid="PRO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 4:3" />Miye name nandaga mwana mta ise, nandaga mwana nikedu huungiswa ni mnala. <verse eid="PRO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 4:4" />Tate nakanihiniza iki, “Utozese ulosi wangu mwo moyo wako naho utoze sigilizi zangu na weye nowikalise. <verse eid="PRO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 4:5" />Waungwa kunda na mzungu na umanyi, unase kujala hegu kulemela ulosi wangu. <verse eid="PRO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 4:6" />Unase kuleka mzungu, nuwo noukulele, uungise vileke ukwamile. <verse eid="PRO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 4:7" />Mbuli yedi vitendese ni kunda na mzungu, lava chochose unanacho ukepatile umanyi. <verse eid="PRO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 4:8" />Uutozese mzungu na uwo umanyi neinkwink'he nt'hunyo, naho una utozesa noukwink'he nt'hunyo. <verse eid="PRO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 4:9" />Naakwink'he taji yedi mwo mtwi wako nouwink'higwe taji yedi itendese.” <verse eid="PRO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 4:10" />Mwanangu tegeleza na kuhokela ulosi wangu, vileke upate miyaka mingi yo kwikala. <verse eid="PRO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 4:11" />Hikulagisa sila yo mzungu, naho hikulongoza mwe sila yo uwagilwa. <verse eid="PRO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 4:12" />Umwo ukagenda houkindilwe naho unaguluka houkobadike. <verse eid="PRO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 4:13" />Tozesa mahinizo yo mzungu unase kuleka yahauke mwako, yaamile kwa wengele kwaviya uwo nuwo ugima wako. <verse eid="PRO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 4:14" />Unase kunda hamwenga na waihi, hegu kutimila migendele ya want'hu waihile. <verse eid="PRO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 4:15" />Kenege ne sila iyo ihile, hituka uite hale. <verse eid="PRO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 4:16" />Waihi hawakugona hawanadamanye yaihile, hawapate nt'hongo hawana mbanange mnt'hu. <verse eid="PRO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 4:17" />Kwaviya woho wadya nk'hande ikulawa mwo uwihi, na kunywa divai ikulawa mwe nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 4:18" />Mna sila ya want'hu wedi ni enga ung'azi wa kilokilo, uwo ung'azi wakwe walangaza mpaka nomsi vitendese. <verse eid="PRO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 4:19" />Mna sila za want'hu waihi ni enga ziza dititihale, hawakumanya icho kikuwatenda wakobadike.<verse eid="PRO 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 4:20" />Mwanangu tegeleza kwa wengele na kuhokela makanyo yangu, wive sigilizi zangu. <verse eid="PRO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 4:21" />Sema unaleke zihauke mwako, naho yatozese mwo moyo wako. <verse eid="PRO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 4:22" />Kwaviya ayo ni ugima kwa mnt'hu akuyapata, naho nuwo mti mwo mwili wakwe wose. <verse eid="PRO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 4:23" />Amila umoyo wako kwa wengele wose, kwaviya umwo mwalawa nch'oko zo ugima. <verse eid="PRO 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 4:24" />Wikale hale na want'hu waihile, hegu milomo yako isekutambula milosi yo udant'hi. <verse eid="PRO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 4:25" />Meso yako yakaule kulongole, naho ukaulise kulongole mazuwa yose. <verse eid="PRO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 4:26" />Ziike vedi sila zako noumbokele, lugendo lwako lwose nolwo nolunde lwedi. <verse eid="PRO 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 4:27" />Usekuhituka kumoso hegu kulume, wikale hale no uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 4:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PRO 5" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo mwo uhabwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 5:1" />Mwanangu tegeleza mzungu wangu, naho wive umanyi wangu <verse eid="PRO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 5:2" />Naho noudahe kunda na mzungu, na milomo yako inde na umanyi. <verse eid="PRO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 5:3" />Milosi ya pamp'he inamwiile enga uki, kiya akulonga ni chedi kujink'ha mavuta ya mzaituni, <verse eid="PRO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 5:4" />mna ko uheelo yanda isungu enga sungwi naho yasenga enga sime. <verse eid="PRO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 5:5" />Viga vakwe vahinga mwo kubanika, nk'hacho zakwe zagendeela kwe kikuta. <verse eid="PRO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 5:6" />Yehe hakuikaula sila yo ugima, sila zakwe ni za kwangadika du, mna hamanyize.<verse eid="PRO 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 5:7" />Haluse nyuwe wanangu nitegelezeni, naho mse kujala ulosi wangu. <verse eid="PRO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 5:8" />Sila zenyu zinde hale na yehe, naho mse kunda hagihi ne nyumba yakwe. <verse eid="PRO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 5:9" />Use kuwenk'ha watuhu nt'hunyo yako, na waihile wakukome weye. <verse eid="PRO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 5:10" />Wata kwiza sema wanakeiguse mwo ugoli wako, na ndima zako zikanda mwe nyumba za want'hu watuhu. <verse eid="PRO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 5:11" />Mwa mazuwa yako ya uheelo wikazi wako nouhongeze, umwo kudalahala kwako. <verse eid="PRO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 5:12" />Aho nougambe, “Ivo niihiye makanyo, na kubela kufank'hilwa mwo moyo wangu? <verse eid="PRO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 5:13" />Hiitegeleze izwi dya wahinizi wangu, hegu kuweva wahinizi wangu. <verse eid="PRO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 5:14" />Haluse nihagihi na kwingila soni, na kuswesa nt'hunyo kwa want'hu.”<verse eid="PRO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 5:15" />Mkaziwo ni enga sima dya mazi yedi naho unywe mazi ye disima dyako mwenye. <verse eid="PRO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 5:16" />Nii mazi ye nch'oko zako uyetile hale, na vizuto va mazi mwe sila? <verse eid="PRO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 5:17" />Ayo uyaleke yande yako mwenye, usekuhanganyila na mnt'hu. <verse eid="PRO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 5:18" />Unde na kinyemi kwa mkaziwo, naho welelwe ni mkaziwo uyo umlombile. <verse eid="PRO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 5:19" />Ni ywedi ahomboele, uwedi wakwe welela kila lupisi, naho kwa lukunde lwakwe welelwe mazuwa yose. <verse eid="PRO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 5:20" />Mwanangu nii kukailwa ni mvele mhabwasi? Naho nii umkumbatile mvele wa mwenye? <verse eid="PRO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 5:21" />Kwaviya sila zo mnt'hu zi mwazi ha Zumbe Mnungu, naho yehe ahima yadya yose udamanye. <verse eid="PRO 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 5:22" />Mnt'hu mwavu agwilwa ni wavu wakwe mwenye, Naho agwilwa mwo udamanyi wakwe wiihile. <verse eid="PRO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 5:23" />Naabanike uyo kwa kuswesa makanyo, naage kwa uhezi wakwe mkulu.<verse eid="PRO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PRO 6" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo matuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 6:1" />Mwanangu, uneva kukelava mwenye kwa mbwiyayo, na kuika lagano kwa mnt'hu mtakwiza, <verse eid="PRO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 6:2" />uneva kukegwila kwa milosi yako mwenye naho kuketoza kwa malagano ayo uyaikile. <verse eid="PRO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 6:3" />Umanye kugamba umwe ukaulizi wa uyo miyawo, mna mwanangu ukaunga kukeyokola, ivo damanya aya, Mwitile uyo miyawo kwa kukeseleza umlombeze akulekele. <verse eid="PRO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 6:4" />Sema unagone nt'hongo, hegu kukupila. <verse eid="PRO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 6:5" />Keyokole kwa kukenega enga mbala kulawa mwo mtego, naho enga madege kulawa mwo ulalavi.<verse eid="PRO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 6:6" />Weye msokezi, sungila umswa naho ufanyanye sila zakwe vileke upate umanyi. <verse eid="PRO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 6:7" />Mswa hauna kilongozi hegu mkulu hegu mkimalizi, <verse eid="PRO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 6:8" />mna wakeikila nk'hande mwo lupisi lwa uvuni, naho vakeduganyila kindolo mwo lupisi lwa ulozo. <verse eid="PRO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 6:9" />Weye msokezi, nougone mpaka ini? Nowinuke ini mwe zint'hongo zako? <verse eid="PRO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 6:10" />Wagamba, “Nileke nigone hadodo du, naho goja mikono ihumule hadodo” <verse eid="PRO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 6:11" />Mwo lupisi ulo ukiwa noukubwiile enga mhoki, naho ukiwa uwo noukutimile enga mbavi ana vitoanilo.<verse eid="PRO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 6:12" />Mnt'hu mwavu na mlulimi, uyo hana wambizi kint'hu, akangadika uku akalonga mbuli ziihile. <verse eid="PRO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 6:13" />Akakonyeza na uku akalava kilagiso kwa viga, na kwa vidole vakwe vileke amluvye. <verse eid="PRO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 6:14" />Akanda kamema kuluvya mwo moyo wakwe uku akafanyanya maihi, akabwelekeza nk'humbizi kila hant'hu. <verse eid="PRO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 6:15" />Kulawa mwa ayo akudamanya makunt'ho nayamkup'hukile naho naabanangwe haheina kuhona.<verse eid="PRO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 6:16" />Kuna vint'hu mtandatu akuihiwa Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="li" vid="PRO 6:16">Naho, viyaho mfungate vikumgela maya. <verse eid="PRO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 6:17" />Meso ya kitugu</para>
  <para style="li" vid="PRO 6:17">Lulimi lwa udanti,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="PRO 6:17">Mikono ikukoma want'hu heweena masa, <verse eid="PRO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 6:18" />moyo ukuika mzungu wiihile</para>
  <para style="li" vid="PRO 6:18">Viga vikuguluka kudamanya uwihi, <verse eid="PRO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 6:19" />Muwona ywa lulimi akubwelekeza lulimi na kuwatenda wandugu wagombe.<verse eid="PRO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo mwe mbuli yo uhabwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 6:20" />Mwanangu tozesa malagizo ya iso naho unase kujala mahinizo ya nyokwe. <verse eid="PRO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 6:21" />Uyaike mwo moyo wako mazuwa yose, naho uyakaulisise. <verse eid="PRO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 6:22" />Umwo ukagenda nayakulongoze, umwo ukagona nayakwamile, umwo ukenuka nayakulangilize. <verse eid="PRO 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 6:23" />Kwaviya sigilizi iyo ni enga lumuli, naho sigilizi iyo ni enga ung'azi, makanyo ayo ni yedi nayakuike mwe sila yo ugima. <verse eid="PRO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 6:24" />Nayakwamile na mvele aihile, nayakuike hale na milosi inamwiile ya mvele mhabwasi. <verse eid="PRO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 6:25" />Usekumunk'hilwa na uyo mvele kwa uwedi wakwe, hegu unase kuzumila kugwilwa na meso yakwe. <verse eid="PRO 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 6:26" />Mnt'hu aza kabesu ko mkate kwa mhabwasi, mvele ywa mnt'hu mtuhu naakuhose uwaze ugima wako.<verse eid="PRO 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 6:27" />Togola mnt'hu adaha kuika moto mwe kizibau mwe kifua na suke zako zisekuhya? <verse eid="PRO 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 6:28" />Togola mnt'hu adaha kujata nk'hala zo moto, na visigino vakwe visekuhya? <verse eid="PRO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 6:29" />Nivo vili mgosi naagende na mvele wa miyawe, yeyose naagende na mvele uyo haalekigwe kusengelwa. <verse eid="PRO 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 6:30" />Want'hu hawakumbela mbavi umwo anabawa kwajili ye sala, <verse eid="PRO 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 6:31" />mna anagwilwa aungwa alihe nk'hanana mfungate, naho naalave ugoli wose ananawo. <verse eid="PRO 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 6:32" />Mgosi akugenda na mvele wa mwenye ni mhezi, naho akebananga yehe mwenye. <verse eid="PRO 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 6:33" />Naafyalikwe na soni heiyauke mwakwe na mabezo naayapate hayahauke mwake. <verse eid="PRO 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 6:34" />Kwaviya wivu wa mgosiwe wamtendesa ande na luhahila, umwo akalihiza kikoda haande na mbazi. <verse eid="PRO 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 6:35" />Haazumile maliho yoyose hegu kwink'hwa geleko dyodyose.<verse eid="PRO 6:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PRO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 7:1" />Mwanangu usekujala milosi yangu naho tozesa malagizo yangu. <verse eid="PRO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 7:2" />Zitimile sigilizi zangu weye nawe nowikalise, uyamile mahinizo yangu enga kint'hu kikwamiliswa. <verse eid="PRO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 7:3" />Mwo lupisi lwose uyakumbukile mahinizo yangu, na uyaike mawandiko yangu mwo moyo wako. <verse eid="PRO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 7:4" />Ulele mzungu enga lumbudyo, umanyi nawo enga nduguyo ywa hagihi. <verse eid="PRO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 7:5" />Nevikwamile hale na mvele mhabwasi, nevikwenege na milosi inamwiile ya mvele hi mhuwilwa.<verse eid="PRO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvele mhabwasi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 7:6" />Kwe nyumba yangu nasungilaga kuse kombokela mwe didilisha, <verse eid="PRO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 7:7" />nawaonaga wabwanga wabindile wingi wahezi, na yumwenga ywawe andilisaga mhezi. <verse eid="PRO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 7:8" />Uyo andaga akagenda mwe sila iidya, hagihi na hadya nekekala mvele, ivo niyo atoza isila ya kuita kwa mvele uyo, <verse eid="PRO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 7:9" />yandaga mwo lupisi lwa kisingi, kilo chandaga kiingila, <verse eid="PRO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 7:10" />mvele uyo abwilanaga na uyo mbwanga, avalaga enga mhabwasi naho akanda na mzungu wakwe. <verse eid="PRO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 7:11" />Andaga mvele mta lwasu naho mnk'hani, naho hakwikala hasi. <verse eid="PRO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 7:12" />Mwe zisila hegu mwe magwilo, na nt'hendelo zose anyatila wagosi. <verse eid="PRO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 7:13" />Amkumbatilaga mbwanga uyo na kumnonela, na kwa milosi inamwiile na kumgamba, <verse eid="PRO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 7:14" />“Hilava malavo yangu ya mwivano, na dyelo ino hikint'hiza lagano dyangu. <verse eid="PRO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 7:15" />Nivo vilekile nifose nize husingile, hikuzungulisa mna hikupata. <verse eid="PRO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 7:16" />Hikunk'hunta vedi lusazi lwangu, kwa mashuka ya langi ya kitani kulawa Misili ina midolonyo. <verse eid="PRO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 7:17" />Higela mhemp'he na manemane, udi na mdalasini. <verse eid="PRO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 7:18" />So kigone mpaka mtondo, wize kikebwedeze vedi. <verse eid="PRO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 7:19" />Mgosi wangu hehali mwe nyumba, kaita utafi wa hale. <verse eid="PRO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 7:20" />Kaguha dunya dya matundu, haasunguse kuuya kaya mpaka mwezi ukusila.” <verse eid="PRO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 7:21" />Amluvyaga kwa milosi inamwiile ya kumhembeleza, mbwanga uyo niyo aluvigwa kwa milosi iiyo. <verse eid="PRO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 7:22" />Aaho amtimilaga mvele uyo enga ng'ombe ikuita ko kuchinjwa, enga kapala kakugwilwa mwo mtego, <verse eid="PRO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 7:23" />habunk'hulaga kugamba iyo neibanange wikazi wakwe, mpaka abula enga kalasigwa msale mwo moyo wakwe, naho andaga enga dege dikuhinga mwo mtego hahena kumanya kugamba neibange wikazi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 7:24" />Haluse wanangu nitegelezeni, naho mwive milosi yangu. <verse eid="PRO 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 7:25" />Use kuzumila moyo wako kumtimila mvele uyo, hegu mnase komboka mwe zisila zakwe. <verse eid="PRO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 7:26" />Kwaviya kawagwesa wagosi wabindile wingi na kuwachinja. <verse eid="PRO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 7:27" />Nyumba yakwe ni sila ya kuita kwe vikuta naho sila ni ya kuhinga kwo mnyongomela.<verse eid="PRO 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PRO 8" />
  <para style="s">Mzungu watunywa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 8:1" />Tegelezeni mzungu wetanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:1">umanyi wakweza izwi dyakwe.<verse eid="PRO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 8:2" />Mnanga mwe vigulu hagihi ne sila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:2">mwe sila mp'handa naho akimalaga.<verse eid="PRO 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 8:3" />Hagihi ne zink'hili zo mwingilo wo mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:3">hant'hu wakwingiila want'hu awetanga kwa izwi kulu akagamba:<verse eid="PRO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 8:4" />“Nyuwe want'hu wose nawetangani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:4">lwitango lwangu ni kwaajili ya kuwalalika want'hu wose.<verse eid="PRO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 8:5" />Nyuwe wahezi kehinizeni kunda na umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:5">tegelezeni kwa wengele nyuwe wahezi.<verse eid="PRO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 8:6" />Tegelezeseni kwaviya icho huunga nilonge ni kint'hu chedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:6">mwe milomo yangu nomlawe milosi ya kindedi.<verse eid="PRO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 8:7" />Mwe milomo yangu nenilonge ikindedi du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:7">uwihi ni ihizo mwe milomo yangu.<verse eid="PRO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 8:8" />Milosi yangu iyo hulonga ni kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:8">udant'hi ni uwihi mwe milongo yangu.<verse eid="PRO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 8:9" />Kwa mnt'hu akubunk'hula kila kint'hu chedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:9">kwa mta mzungu wose ni wedi.<verse eid="PRO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 8:10" />Sagula mahinizo yangu kujink'ha masawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:10">na umanyi kujink'ha zahabu yedi.”<verse eid="PRO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 8:11" />“Miye mzungu ni ywedi kujink'ha iwe dya yombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:11">chochose noumunk'hilwe nacho hakikudaha kuligana na miye.<verse eid="PRO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 8:12" />Miye ni mzungu nekala hamwenga na umanyi na ubala.<verse eid="PRO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 8:13" />Kumvika Zumbe Mnungu ni kuihiwa ni uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:13">naihiwa na kitugu na kukeduvya na wikazi wiihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:13">naho naihiwa na milosi ihile.<verse eid="PRO 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 8:14" />Nina udahi wa kulangiliza naho nna mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:14">nna umanyi na ludole.<verse eid="PRO 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 8:15" />Kwa wambizi wangu maseuta walongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:15">na vilongozi waika sigilizi zedi.<verse eid="PRO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 8:16" />Kwa wambizi wangu vilongozi walongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:16">iviya iviya wakulu na walamuzi.<verse eid="PRO 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 8:17" />Nawaungisa wadya wakuniungisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:17">wakunizungulisa kwa kukombeka nawanipate.<verse eid="PRO 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 8:18" />Ugoli na nt'hunyo vi hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:18">ugoli wa mazuwa yose na uvikilwa.<verse eid="PRO 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 8:19" />Matunda yangu ni yedi kujink'ha zahabu yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:19">upati wangu wahuma upati udya wa masawa yedi.<verse eid="PRO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 8:20" />Nagenda mwe sila yo uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:20">natimila sila ya kindedi.<verse eid="PRO 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 8:21" />Miye nawenk'ha ugoli wadya wakuniunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:21">namemeza vindolo mwe zinyumba zawe wadya wakuniungisa.”<verse eid="PRO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 8:22" />“Zumbe Mnungu aniumbaga nk'hongo mwe zi ndima zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:22">umwo andaga hadamanye kint'hu chochose.<verse eid="PRO 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 8:23" />Naumbwagwa nk'hongo mwo lupisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:23">nandaga aaho uku hainati isi kukonga.<verse eid="PRO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 8:24" />Nelekagwa kukanda nk'hongelo ye bahali ikanda hainati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:24">kukanda hakunati nch'oko zose kukonga kulava mazi.”<verse eid="PRO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 8:25" />Umwo milima ikanda hainati kuikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:25">na vigulu kuikwa hant'hu hakwe, miye nandaga aaho,<verse eid="PRO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 8:26" />Mnungu akanda hanati kuumba isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:26">hegu sanga ya nk'hongo ye isi.<verse eid="PRO 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 8:27" />Nandaga aho kukongela aho mbingu yaikagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:27">umwo atoaga mihaka mwe bahali.<verse eid="PRO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 8:28" />Mwo kukint'hiza mavunde mwo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:28">umwo azidamanya nch'oko za bahali.<verse eid="PRO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 8:29" />Umwo aikaga mihaka we bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:29">amazi sema yanabanange miko yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:29">naho andaga kaika nk'hongelo ye isi.<verse eid="PRO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 8:30" />Nandaga hamwenga nae enga mmanyi ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:30">nandaga kinyemi chakwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:30">nangaga hakwe mazuwa yose,<verse eid="PRO 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 8:31" />umwo nandaga na kinyemi ne isi hamwenga na want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:31">na kwelelwa kunda hamwenga na want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 8:32" />“Haluse wanangu nitegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:32">wavikilwa wadya wakutimila sila zangu.<verse eid="PRO 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 8:33" />Tegelezeni mahinizo mpate mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:33">hegu mnase kuyalemela.<verse eid="PRO 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 8:34" />Ni vedi kwa mnt'hu yudya akunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:34">akagojela uvikilwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:34">akucheleza akanilombeza.<verse eid="PRO 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 8:35" />Akunipata miye kapata ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:35">naho naande kauungiswa ni Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PRO 8:36" />Mna hekuniunga miye naande kakebananga yehe mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:36">wose wakuniihiya waungasa kubanika.”<verse eid="PRO 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PRO 9" />
  <para style="s">Mzungu na uhezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 9:1" />Mzungu uzenga nyumba yakwe, nyumba ina mikimailo mfungate. <verse eid="PRO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 9:2" />Kachinja mifugwa kwajili ye fugo, divai yakwe kaika chalumwe. Naho kaika lumwe meza yakwe. <verse eid="PRO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 9:3" />Kawasigila wasank'hani wakwe ko mzi, wawetange want'hu kwo lunenengwa lwe vigulu. <verse eid="PRO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 9:4" />“Yeyose eli mhezi eze aha!” Na yeyose mbwalasi amgamba, <verse eid="PRO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 9:5" />“Soo ukadye nk'hande, naho unywe divai nidamanye. <verse eid="PRO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 9:6" />Lekeni sila zenyu za uhezi vileke mwikalise, mtimile sila zo uwagilwa.”<verse eid="PRO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 9:7" />Mnt'hu yeyose akumkanya mta lubezo azungula kuhomolwa, uyo akumuogola mwiihi enk'higwa makunt'ho. <verse eid="PRO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 9:8" />Usekumkanya mta lubezo kwaviya naakuihiye, mkanye mta mzungu na yehe naakuungise. <verse eid="PRO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 9:9" />Mhinize mta mzungu na yehe naatendese kunda na umanyi, naho mhinize mbala na yehe naatendese kunda mbala.<verse eid="PRO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 9:10" />Kumvika Zumbe Mnungu ni nk'hongelo yo umanyi, na kummanya yudya akukile, ni kupata ubala. <verse eid="PRO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 9:11" />Kwaviya kwa wambizi wangu, mazuwa yako nayagenyele, naho wikazi wako nounde wa mazuwa mengi. <verse eid="PRO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 9:12" />Uneva una mzungu noukuwagile weye mwenye, naho unabela noupate makunt'ho weye mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 9:13" />Mvele mhezi ana lwasu, hamanyize kint'hu naho hana soni. <verse eid="PRO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 9:14" />Ekala mwe nk'hili ye nyumba yakwe hegu aika difumbi dyakwe hant'hu henuke ho mzi, <verse eid="PRO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 9:15" />na kuwetanga want'hu wakomboka mwe sila, want'hu wakuita kwe zindima zawe. <verse eid="PRO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 9:16" />“Yeyose eli mhezi eze aha!” Na wose weli wahezi soni uku kundani. <verse eid="PRO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 9:17" />“Mazi ya ubavi yanamwiile vitendese, mkate ukudigwa kwa kinyele ni wedi utendese.” <verse eid="PRO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 9:18" />Mna hawamanyize kugamba uko kundani kuna wabanike, wata kwiza wa uyo mvele weyumo mndani ko mnyongomela.<verse eid="PRO 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PRO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ngelo za Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 10:1" />Izi ni ngelo za Selemini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:1">Mwana mta mzungu ni kinyemi kwa ise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:1">mna mwana mhezi ni kinyulu kwa nine.<verse eid="PRO 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 10:2" />Ugoli ukupata kwa sila ihiile hiyo wedi, mna uwedi wamyokola mnt'hu kulawa mwo kubanika.<verse eid="PRO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 10:3" />Zumbe Mnungu hakuwaleka want'hu wedi wapate gumbo, mna abananga zindima za want'hu waihile.<verse eid="PRO 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 10:4" />Usokezi watenda mnt'hu ande mkiwa, mna mnt'hu akukombeka apata ugoli.<verse eid="PRO 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 10:5" />Mta umanyi aduganya nk'hande mwo ulozo, kugona mwo lupisi lwa uvuni ni kupata soni.<verse eid="PRO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 10:6" />Mnt'hu ywedi apata uvikilwa yehe mwenye, mna mnt'hu mwavu adamanya kitugu.<verse eid="PRO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 10:7" />Nk'humbukila ya wata uwagilwa ni ya uvikilwa, mna waihi nawajaligwe vitendese.<verse eid="PRO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 10:8" />Mta mzungu mwo moyo wake azumila sigilizi, mna mnt'hu akulonga uhezi du naabanike.<verse eid="PRO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 10:9" />Akwikala kwo uhuwilwa kwa Zumbe Mnungu neekalise mwe isi, mna akwaza sila zakwe naamanyike du.<verse eid="PRO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 10:10" />Uyo akukonyeza kwa uwihi egala masulumizo, mna akukanya kwa kindedi egala utondowazi.<verse eid="PRO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 10:11" />Mta uwedi ni nc'hoko yo ugima, mna mnt'hu mwavu adamanya kitugu.<verse eid="PRO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 10:12" />Uwihi wegala nk'humbizi, mna lukunde lwagubika masa yose.<verse eid="PRO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 10:13" />Mzungu wapatikana mwe milomo ya wata mizungu, mna wahezi nawasengelwe.<verse eid="PRO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 10:14" />Wata mzungu waika umanyi, mna kwa wadya wahezi wakulalata wegala ubanangi.<verse eid="PRO 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 10:15" />Ugoli wa mnt'hu mgoli ni mzi wawe uzengelwe gomela, mna ukiwa wa mnt'hu mkiwa wamwigaila ubanangi.<verse eid="PRO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 10:16" />Maliho ya muwagilwa ni ugima, mna mwihi anda mwo wavu.<verse eid="PRO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 10:17" />Akuzumila kukanywa, uyo anda mwe sila yo ugima, mna yeyose akulemela kuogolwa naande kaga.<verse eid="PRO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 10:18" />Akumwiihiya miyawe kwa kinyele uyo mlulimi, akumsongeleza miyawe uyo ni mhezi.<verse eid="PRO 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 10:19" />Hana mbuli nyingi hahakuswesa uwihi, mna akukindila lulimi lwakwe ana mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 10:20" />Ulosi wa mnt'hu ywedi ni enga masawa yedi, mna fanyanyi za mnt'hu mwiihi hazina uwagilwa wowose.<verse eid="PRO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 10:21" />Ulosi wa mnt'hu ywedi waungigwa ni want'hu wabindile wingi, mna wahezi waganika kwa kuswesa ubala.<verse eid="PRO 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 10:22" />Uvikilwa wa Zumbe Mnungu wegala ugoli, mna haikwigala kinyulu.<verse eid="PRO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 10:23" />Kwa mhezi kudamanya wavu ni enga mseigo, mna want'hu wata umanyi wanda na kinyemi mwo mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 10:24" />Icho akogoha mnt'hu mwihi nicho kikumpata, mna icho akuunga mnt'hu ywedi nicho akupata.<verse eid="PRO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 10:25" />Kisingisa kikaomboka chomboka na mnt'hu mwiihi, mna mnt'hu ywedi atogezwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PRO 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 10:26" />Enga ivo dili kwazu mwa meno na mosi mwa meso, nivo eli mnt'hu msokezi kwa mkuluwe.<verse eid="PRO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 10:27" />Kumvika Zumbe Mnungu kwatenda wikalise mwe isi, mna kwikala kwa mnt'hu mwiihi ni kudodo.<verse eid="PRO 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 10:28" />Kawiilo dya mnt'hu ywedi dina kinyemi, mna kawiilo dya mnt'hu mwiihi hi kint'hu.<verse eid="PRO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 10:29" />Zumbe Mnungu awamila want'hu wedi, mna wakudamanya maihi nawabanangwe.<verse eid="PRO 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 10:30" />Want'hu wedi hawahauswe mwe isi, mna waihi hawekale mwe isi.<verse eid="PRO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 10:31" />Mwo mnomo wa mnt'hu ywedi mwalawa mzungu, mna lulimi lwa mnt'hu mwiihi nolusengelwe.<verse eid="PRO 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 10:32" />Milomo ya want'hu wedi wayamanya yadya yakuzumilwa kulongwa, mna milomo ya want'hu waihi walonga du maihi.<verse eid="PRO 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PRO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 11:1" />Mizani ya udant'hi ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mna kihimo kikuhima vedi ni kinyemi kwakwe.<verse eid="PRO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 11:2" />Want'hu wata kitugu wengilaga soni, mna want'hu wakukeseleza wana mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 11:3" />Uwedi wa wata uwagilwa wawalongoza, mna want'hu hiyo wahuwilwa nawabanangwe ne zinyambi zawe.<verse eid="PRO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 11:4" />Ugoli hauna kint'hu mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo, mna uwagilwa wayokola kulawa mwo kubanika.<verse eid="PRO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 11:5" />Uwagilwa wa want'hu heweena lema wawadamanyila sila yedi, mna waihi wakebananga woho wenye.<verse eid="PRO 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 11:6" />Want'hu wata uwagilwa nawayokolwe ni uwagilwa, mna wata finju nawabanangwe.<verse eid="PRO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 11:7" />Mwiihi anabanika na kawiilo dyakwe dibanika, vose akukawiila kwa ludole lwakwe lwanda hi kint'hu.<verse eid="PRO 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 11:8" />Mnt'hu mta uwedi ayokolwa mwe makunt'ho, na mnt'hu mwiihi anda uumwo mwe makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 11:9" />Hekumvika Zumbe Mnungu abananga watuhu kwa milosi yakwe, mna mnt'hu ywedi ayokolwa kwa umanyi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 11:10" />Want'hu wedi wanapata yedi mzi wose wanda na kinyemi, na waihi wanabanangwa want'hu nawatowe ng'helegele.<verse eid="PRO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 11:11" />Mzi wanda na upati kwaviya want'hu wakwe wamvika Zumbe Mnungu, mna mzi wabanangwa kwa milosi ya want'hu waihi.<verse eid="PRO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 11:12" />Akumbela miyawe hana ubala, mnt'hu mta mzungu anyamala du.<verse eid="PRO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 11:13" />Msongezi aza kawiilo, mna mnt'hu mhuwilwa anda na kinyele.<verse eid="PRO 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 11:14" />Haheina ulangilizi, si yabanika, mna hana walangilizi wengi handa hatondowala.<verse eid="PRO 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 11:15" />Akumwamila mta kwiza neeze akekalalize, mna hekuwamila want'hu enga awo naande na kutondowala.<verse eid="PRO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 11:16" />Mvele ywedi naatunywe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PRO 11:16">mgosi heena mbazi naande mgoli du.<verse eid="PRO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 11:17" />Mnt'hu mkise anda na upati yehe mwenye, mna mnt'hu aihile akelumiza yehe mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 11:18" />Upati wa mnt'hu mwihi ni wa udant'hi, mna akudamanya yedi naapate upati wa kindedi.<verse eid="PRO 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 11:19" />Mnt'hu akuunga ande mhuwilwa naande mgima, mna akusagula kudamanya maihi naabanike.<verse eid="PRO 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 11:20" />Zumbe Mnungu awaihiya vitendese want'hu wata myoyo ihile, mna elelwa ni wadya wakudamanya uwagilwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 11:21" />Ikindedi mwiihi haadahe kunyilika kusengelwa, mna want'hu wedi nawayokolwe.<verse eid="PRO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 11:22" />Mvele ywedi heena mzungu, ni enga mp'hete ya zahabu imwe mp'hula ya nguluwe.<verse eid="PRO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 11:23" />Makawiilo ya want'hu wana uwagilwa yandaga yedi, kawiilo dya waiihi di mwa maya yatendese ya Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 11:24" />Akulava kwa ukise andilisa mgoli, mna mnt'hu mgila akedamanyila ukiwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 11:25" />Mnt'hu mkise naande mpati, akumwambiza miyawe naye naambizwe.<verse eid="PRO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 11:26" />Want'hu wamligita akufisa nk'hande akagoja yombe dikwele, mna wamuungila uvikilwa yudya akutaga.<verse eid="PRO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 11:27" />Akuzungula kudamanya ayedi apata uwagilwa, mna akuzungula kudamanya yaihile naambwiilwe ni yaihile.<verse eid="PRO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 11:28" />Akuhuwila ugoli wake naatomoke enga zani dinyaile, mna mhuwila naande enga zani teke.<verse eid="PRO 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 11:29" />Yeyose akwigala makunt'ho mwe mp'huga yakwe haande na kint'hu ko uheelo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PRO 11:29">Mna mhezi naande mtumwa kwa wata mizungu.<verse eid="PRO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 11:30" />Udamanyi wa mnt'hu muwagilwa wegala ugima, mna ubanangi wahausa ugima.<verse eid="PRO 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 11:31" />Uneva muwagilwa apata nt'hunyo aha he isi, kindedi mnt'hu mta wavu naye naasulumizwe.<verse eid="PRO 11:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PRO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 12:1" />Yeyose akuunga kukanywa aunga mzungu, mna heekuunga kukanywa uyo mhezi.<verse eid="PRO 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 12:2" />Mnt'hu ywedi amilwa ni Zumbe Mnungu, mna akuika mzungu wiihile naaligitwe ni Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 12:3" />Hakuna akudaha kutoga kwa kudamanya yaihile, mna mnt'hu muwagilwa hakudahika kuuswa.<verse eid="PRO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 12:4" />Mvele ywedi ni nt'hunyo kwa mgosiwe, akumgela soni mgosiwe ni enga kuola mwa mavuha ya mgosiwe.<verse eid="PRO 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 12:5" />Fanyanyi za mnt'hu mhuwilwa ni za uwagilwa, mna fanyanyi za mnt'hu mwiihi ni za udant'hi.<verse eid="PRO 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 12:6" />Milosi ya want'hu wata uwihi ni kuunga kukoma heweena masa, mna milosi ya want'hu wata uwagilwa ni kuunga kuwayokola.<verse eid="PRO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 12:7" />Waihi wabanangwa pele, mna mp'huga ya wahuwilwa yakimala itogile.<verse eid="PRO 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 12:8" />Mnt'hu atunywa kwa fanyanyi zakwe zedi, mna mnt'hu abelwa kwa fanyanyi zakwe za kihezi.<verse eid="PRO 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 12:9" />Ni vedi mnt'hu heena kint'hu akukedaha yehe mwenye, kujink'ha mnt'hu akuketenda mkulu mna hana nk'hande.<verse eid="PRO 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 12:10" />Mnt'hu mhuwilwa akaulisa mifugwa yake, mna mnt'hu mwiihi ni kwank'walu kwe mifugwa yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 12:11" />Mnimi akukombatiza ana nk'hande, mna akutimila mbuli za kihezi hana ubala.<verse eid="PRO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 12:12" />Waihi waunga upati hewe wagilwe, mna mnt'hu muwagilwa akimala atogile.<verse eid="PRO 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 12:13" />Mnt'hu mwiihi agwilwa ni zimbuli zakwe mwenye, mna mta uwagilwa haapate makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 12:14" />Mnt'hu anda na upati viligane ne milosi yakwe, ndima akuzidamanya nazo zamwink'ha upati.<verse eid="PRO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 12:15" />Mhezi aiyona sila yakwe kunda yedi kwakwe, mna mta mzungu ategeleza ulangilizi.<verse eid="PRO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 12:16" />Maya ya mhezi yasunguza kumanyika, mna mta uwagilwa ayabela maihi.<verse eid="PRO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 12:17" />Akulonga kindedi alava uwona wa kindedi, mna muwona wa udant'hi alava uwona wa udant'hi.<verse eid="PRO 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 12:18" />Milosi ihile yalumiza enga sime, mna ulosi wa mta mzungu wagela uhonyi.<verse eid="PRO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 12:19" />Kindedi chekala mazuwa yose, mna lulimi haukwikalisa.<verse eid="PRO 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 12:20" />Wakuika mzungu wa maihi wamema udant'hi mwo moyo, mna wakuunga ayedi wapata kinyemi.<verse eid="PRO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 12:21" />Want'hu wedi haweziilwe ni mbuli yeyose iihile, mna waihi wana makunt'ho mengi.<verse eid="PRO 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 12:22" />Lulimi ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mna want'hu wakulonga kindedi ni kinyemi kwakwe.<verse eid="PRO 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 12:23" />Wata mzungu wafisa umanyi wawe, mna wahezi wabwelekeza uhezi wawe.<verse eid="PRO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 12:24" />Kukombekesa kwamwink'ha mnt'hu ukulu, mna msokezi naande mtumwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 12:25" />Kiyangayanga mwo moyo kwamswesa mnt'hu kunda na kinyemi, mna mbuli yedi yamsangalaza.<verse eid="PRO 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 12:26" />Mta uwagilwa ni kilongozi ywa miyawe, mna sila ya want'hu waihi yawazaganya woho wenye.<verse eid="PRO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 12:27" />Mnt'hu msokezi haapate kiya ukuunga, mna akukombeka naapate kiya akuunga.<verse eid="PRO 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 12:28" />Uwagilwa ni sila yo ugima, mna uwihi walongoza kwo kubanika.<verse eid="PRO 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PRO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 13:1" />Mwana mta mzungu neeve makanyo ya ise, mna mta lubezo hakwiva akakanywa.<verse eid="PRO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 13:2" />Mnt'hu ywedi apata upati kulawa mwe milosi yakwe yedi, mna walulimi waungisa nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 13:3" />Akwamila mnomo wakwe amila wikazi wakwe, mta kilongelonge akebananga yehe mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 13:4" />Msokezi amunk'hilwa mna hakupata chochose, mna wose wakukombeka wapatisa.<verse eid="PRO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 13:5" />Mnt'hu mhuwilwa aihiya lulimi, mna mwiihi adamanya kwa soni na kuhuza.<verse eid="PRO 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 13:6" />Uwedi wawaamila wadya wata lugendo lwedi, mna wavu wawagwesa waiihi.<verse eid="PRO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 13:7" />Wamwenga waketenda wagoli, ikindedi chakwe hawana kint'hu, watuhu wakeona wakiwa mna ikindedi wana ugoli.<verse eid="PRO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 13:8" />Ugoli wa mnt'hu wadaha kuyokola wikazi wakwe, mna mkiwa hana cho kutiswa.<verse eid="PRO 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 13:9" />Mnt'hu ywedi ang'alisa enga lumuli lukukweela vedi, mna waihi ni enga lumuli lukuzima.<verse eid="PRO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 13:10" />Kitugu chegala nk'humbizi du, mna kwa wadya wakuzumila ulangilizi wedi wana mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 13:11" />Ugoli ukwiza kipump'ha wasunguza kusila, mna akuiduganya mp'halahole yekala naho yagenyela.<verse eid="PRO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 13:12" />Kawiilo dya kugojagoja dyalumiza umoyo, mna kawiilo dikukint'ha nu mti wa ugima.<verse eid="PRO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 13:13" />Yeyose akulemela ulangilizi wedi akegaila makunt'ho, mna akutimila imiko enk'higwa nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 13:14" />Mahinizo ya mnt'hu mta mizungu ni nc'hoko zo ugima, yamhitula mnt'hu kulawa mwe mitego yo kubanika.<verse eid="PRO 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 13:15" />Kunda na mzungu kwegala nt'hunyo, mna sila ya waihi ni ya makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 13:16" />Mta mzungu adamanya kila kint'hu kwa ubala, mna mhezi hakuufisa uhezi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 13:17" />Mwigala ulosi aihile abanikila mwo uwihi, mna mwigala ulosi mhuwilwa egala ugima.<verse eid="PRO 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 13:18" />Yeyose akubela makanyo egala ukiwa na kupata soni, mna yehe akuzumila makanyo apata nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 13:19" />Kawiilo dikint'hile ni dyedi mwo moyo, mna wahezi waihiya kuleka uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 13:20" />Ita hamwenga na wata mzungu na weye nounde na mzungu, mna akukelunga na wahezi napate makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 13:21" />Makunt'ho yampata yudya akudamanya wavu, mna wata uwagilwa nawapate ayedi.<verse eid="PRO 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 13:22" />Mnt'hu ywedi awalekela ukipe welekwa wakwe, mna ugoli wa mnt'hu mta wavu waikilwa want'hu wedi.<verse eid="PRO 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 13:23" />Nk'honde ya mnt'hu mkiwa walava ulozo ubindile wingi, mna haheina ikindedi uwagilwa wahauka.<verse eid="PRO 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 13:24" />Uyo hekumkanya mwanawe hakumuunga, mna akumuunga mwanawe asunguza kumwogola.<verse eid="PRO 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 13:25" />Mnt'hu mta uwagilwa adya na kwiguta, mna mwiihi ana makunt'ho ya sala.<verse eid="PRO 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PRO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 14:1" />Mvele mta mzungu aizenga inyumba yakwe, mna mhezi aimola inyumba yakwe mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 14:2" />Mta lugendo lwedi amvika Zumbe Mnungu, mna mwiihi ambela Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 14:3" />Mhezi akuketugula yehe mwenye asengelwa kwa mbuli zakwe za kihezi, mna mta mzungu amilwa ni ulosi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 14:4" />Haheina ng'ombe zikulima, madewa nayande heyeina kint'hu, ulozo mwingi wapatikana kwa ludole lwa ng'ombe zikulima.<verse eid="PRO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 14:5" />Muwona mkindedi hakulonga mlulimi, mna hekuhuwilwa alonga lulimi.<verse eid="PRO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 14:6" />Mta lubezo azungula mzungu naho hakuupata, mna mta ubala apata umanyi kwa uhufu.<verse eid="PRO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 14:7" />Wikale hale na mnt'hu mhezi, kwaviya houpate mzungu wedi.<verse eid="PRO 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 14:8" />Mzungu wa mnt'hu mta mzungu ni kumanya sila zakwe, mna uhezi wa wahezi wawadant'ha woho wenye.<verse eid="PRO 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 14:9" />Wahezi wasekela wavu, mna uwedi waunga kulekelwa wavu wawe.<verse eid="PRO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 14:10" />Kila mnt'hu amanya usungu wakwe mwenye. Hahali yeyose akudaha kunda na weye mwe aya.<verse eid="PRO 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 14:11" />Nyumba ya mnt'hu mwiihi neibanangwe, mna ya mnt'hu ywedi neitogezwe.<verse eid="PRO 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 14:12" />Iyuko sila ikuoneka kunda yedi kwa mnt'hu mna ko uheelo wakwe yamwigala ko kubanika.<verse eid="PRO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 14:13" />Kinyulu chadaha kukefisa mwe ziseko, mna kinyemi kina halawa, kikwiza ni kinyulu.<verse eid="PRO 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 14:14" />Heweena mhuwi nawabanangwe kwajili ye zisila zawe, na mnt'hu ywedi nenk'higwe nt'hunyo kwajili ye sila yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 14:15" />Mhezi ahuwila kila kint'hu naagambilwe, mna mnt'hu mta mzungu anda kufanyanya sila yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 14:16" />Mnt'hu ywedi amvika Zumbe na kukenega na yaihile, mna mhezi aihiwa kwa uhezi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 14:17" />Mnt'hu akusunguza kuihiwa adamanya mbuli zo uhezi, mna mnt'hu mta nyambi hakuungwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 14:18" />Wahezi wanda wakipe mwo uhezi, mna wata mzungu wavalwa nt'hunyo yo umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 14:19" />Want'hu waihile nawafike madi ha want'hu wedi, want'hu waihile nawafunamize vihanga vawe hasi mwa want'hu wata uwedi. <verse eid="PRO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 14:20" />Hahali akumuunga mkiwa, naho hata na wambuyaze, mna mgoli ana wambuya wengi.<verse eid="PRO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 14:21" />Akumbela miyawe adamanya wavu, mna kavikilwa yudya akuwambiza mkiwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 14:22" />Akuika mzungu wiihile naage, mna akuika mzungu wedi neenk'higwe lukunde holukusila hamwenga na uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 14:23" />Kukombatiza kwa kila ndima kwegala upati, mna simulizi heziina kint'hu zegala ukiwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 14:24" />Ugoli ni nt'hunyo ya wata mzungu, mna uhezi wegala kwo wahezi ukutendesa.<verse eid="PRO 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 14:25" />Muona ywa kindedi ayokola wikazi wakwe, mna muona wo kulonga lulimi ni msezengi.<verse eid="PRO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 14:26" />Akumvika Zumbe Mnungu ana gomela dyedi, naho naande unyilikilo wa wanawe.<verse eid="PRO 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 14:27" />Kumvika Zumbe Mnungu ni nc'hoko zo ugima, yamtenda mnt'hu akenege na mitego yo kubanika.<verse eid="PRO 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 14:28" />Nt'hunyo ya seuta ni kunda na want'hu wengi, mna haheina want'hu ukulu nounde howiina kint'hu.<verse eid="PRO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 14:29" />Mnt'hu heena maya yatendese naande na umanyi mkulu, mna akusunguza kuihiwa agenyeza uhezi.<verse eid="PRO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 14:30" />Utondowazi mwo moyo wamwink'ha mnt'hu ugima, mna finju yatenda mavuha yaole.<verse eid="PRO 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 14:31" />Akumhujila mkiwa amhomola Muumbi ywakwe, mna akumuonela mbazi mkiwa amtunya Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 14:32" />Mwiihi abanangwa kwa udamanyi wakwe wiihile, mna mnt'hu ywedi apata kutondowala kwajili yo uwedi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 14:33" />Mzungu wakelavanya hata kwa mnt'hu mhezi, mna mzungu haukupatikana kwa want'hu wahezi. <verse eid="PRO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 14:34" />Uhuwilwa wagenyeza isi, mna wavu wagela soni kwa want'hu wose.<verse eid="PRO 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 14:35" />Seuta anda na kinyemi kwa wandima wakumanya kiya wakudamanya, mna anda maya kwa wose wakwigala makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PRO 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 15:1" />Uhituzi wa ujalamu, waseleza maya, mna ulosi una luhahila lwakwezela maya.<verse eid="PRO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 15:2" />Lulimi lwa mta mzungu lwagenyeza umanyi, mna milomo ya wahezi yalonga uhezi.<verse eid="PRO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 15:3" />Zumbe Mnungu aona kila kint'hu, ampelemba mnt'hu aihile na mnt'hu ywedi.<verse eid="PRO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 15:4" />Ulosi wedi wegala ugima, mna mbuli za lulimi zabananga moyo.<verse eid="PRO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 15:5" />Mhezi abela mahinizo ya ise, mna akuzumila makanyo naande na mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 15:6" />Mwe kaya ya mnt'hu ywedi mna ugoli utendese, mna icho wakupata waihi ni makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 15:7" />Mnomo wa mta mzungu wagenyeza umanyi, mna hiyo enga ivo ili milomo ya wahezi.<verse eid="PRO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 15:8" />Malavo ya waihi yaihiza kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mna kulombeza kwa muwagilwa kwegela kinyemi kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 15:9" />Lugendo lwa waihi ni ihiyo kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mna Mnungu awaunga wadya wakutimila uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PRO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 15:10" />Masulumizo yamgoja yudya akuleka udamanyi wedi.Yeyose akuihiya kukanywa naabanike.<verse eid="PRO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 15:11" />Uneva Zumbe Mnungu adaha kuona kila kint'hu kikwe isi ya wabanike, fanyanyi za mnt'hu zadaha vivihi kukefisa kwakwe?<verse eid="PRO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 15:12" />Mta lubezo aihiwa na makanyo, haaunge ulangilizi kulawa kwa wata mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 15:13" />Moyo una kinyemi watenda futa isangale, mna usungu wa moyo wautenda futa isekusangala.<verse eid="PRO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 15:14" />Mta umanyi azungula uwedi, mna wahezi weguta uhezi wawe.<verse eid="PRO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 15:15" />Mazuwa yose ya mnt'hu akuhujilwa yaiha du, mna mta moyo usangale ni wila houkusila.<verse eid="PRO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 15:16" />Ni vedi kunda na vint'hu vigeke na kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, kujink'ha kunda na ugoli mwingi hamwenga na makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 15:17" />Ni vedi kudya ugali na mboga za mani hant'hu hana lukunde, kujink'ha kudya ugali na nyama hant'hu hikuungwa.<verse eid="PRO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 15:18" />Mnt'hu mta maya asongeleza nk'humbizi, mna heena uhufu wa maya ahoza nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 15:19" />Sila ya mnt'hu msokezi ikomela miwa, mna sila ya mnt'hu mhuwilwa ipwilika enga sila yedi nk'hulu.<verse eid="PRO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 15:20" />Mwana mta mzungu ambwedeza ise, mna mhezi ambela nine.<verse eid="PRO 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 15:21" />Uhezi ni kinyemi kwa mnt'hu heena ubala, mna mta umanyi asagula sila yedi.<verse eid="PRO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 15:22" />Mizungu yabanika kwa kuswesa ulangilizi, mna kwa walangilizi wengi kwatenda kwedi.<verse eid="PRO 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 15:23" />Kulava uhituzi wedi kwegala kinyemi, mbuli ikuungwa kwa lupisi lwakwe ni yedi vitendese.<verse eid="PRO 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 15:24" />Sila ya mta mzungu yegala ugima, naho yamkindila kuhubugila ko mnyongomela.<verse eid="PRO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 15:25" />Zumbe Mnungu abananga wikazi wa want'hu wata kitugu. Mna amila mihaka ya wikazi wa mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe.<verse eid="PRO 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 15:26" />Fanyanyi za mnt'hu mwiihi ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mna milosi ya want'hu wedi yamwink'ha kinyemi.<verse eid="PRO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 15:27" />Akumunk'hilwa na upati wa matundu ya soni, uyo awangadisa wanduguze, mna akuihiwa na kuhujila neekale. <verse eid="PRO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 15:28" />Moyo wa mnt'hu mhuwilwa wafanyanya ukanda haunati kuhitula, mna moyo wa mnt'hu mwiihi wafanyanya du yaihile.<verse eid="PRO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 15:29" />Zumbe Mnungu ehale na want'hu waihile, mna aweva want'hu wakudamanya yakwelela.<verse eid="PRO 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 15:30" />Mnt'hu mta mbazi aibwedeza myoyo ya want'hu, naho mbuli yedi yagela ludole mwo mwili.<verse eid="PRO 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 15:31" />Mnt'hu akutegeleza makanyo yedi, anda ni yumwenga mwa want'hu wata mizungu.<verse eid="PRO 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 15:32" />Akulemela kuhinizwa, uyo akebela mwenye, mna akuzumila makanyo apata umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 15:33" />Kumvika Zumbe Mnungu kwamhiniza mnt'hu mizungu, naho uneva ukei kutunywa vaungwa unde mjalamu.<verse eid="PRO 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PRO 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 16:1" />Mnt'hu ana mbuli nyingi akuzifanyanya zikulawa mwo moyo wakwe, mna uhituzi wo uheelo walawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 16:2" />Sila zose za mnt'hu zaoneka kunda zedi hameso hakwe mwenye, mna Zumbe Mnungu niye akuhima kiya mnt'hu akuunga kukidamanya.<verse eid="PRO 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 16:3" />Ziike kwa Zumbe Mnungu ndima zako zose izo ukudamanya, na kila icho noudamanye nekinde chedi.<verse eid="PRO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 16:4" />Zumbe Mnungu aumbaga kila kint'hu enga ivo akuunga yehe mwenye, hata waihi kwaajili ye zuwa dyo usengelo.<verse eid="PRO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 16:5" />Zumbe Mnungu aihizwa vitendese na wose wata lubezo, kindedi mnt'hu enga uyo haaswese kusengelwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 16:6" />Kwa lukunde na uhuwilwa wavu wahauswa, kwa kumvika Zumbe Mnungu want'hu hawakudamanya uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 16:7" />Zumbe Mnungu aneleleswa no lugendo lwa mnt'hu, awatenda hata wank'hondo wakwe wekale kwa utondowazi naye.<verse eid="PRO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 16:8" />Ni vedi kupata vint'hu vigeke kwa uhuwilwa kujink'ha ugoli ubindile wingi kwa kuhujila.<verse eid="PRO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 16:9" />Mioyo ya want'hu yafanyanya sila zawe, mna Zumbe Mnungu alongoza lugendo lwawe.<verse eid="PRO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 16:10" />Seuta alamula kwa kulongozwa ni Mnungu, alava usengelo kwa uwagilwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 16:11" />Zumbe Mnungu aunga vihimo ne mizani viligane, maiwe yose yo kuhimila mwo mfuko kayadamanya yehe.<verse eid="PRO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 16:12" />Maseuta wahiizwa vitendese kudamanya uwihi, kwaviya fumbi dya kiseuta didamanywa kwa sila ya uwagilwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 16:13" />Seuta amuungisa mnt'hu yudya akulonga kwa uhuwilwa, naho elelwa na mnt'hu yudya akulonga kindedi.<verse eid="PRO 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 16:14" />Maya ya seuta ni enga mwigala file, mna mnt'hu mta mzungu naaihoze.<verse eid="PRO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 16:15" />Kihanga cha seuta kinang'ala kuna ugima, uwedi wakwe ni enga vunde dya fula ya masika.<verse eid="PRO 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 16:16" />Kupata mzungu ni kwedi kujink'ha zahabu, naho kupata umanyi ni kwedi kujink'ha masawa.<verse eid="PRO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 16:17" />Sila ya wahuwilwa ni kukeika hale na uwihi, yehe akuidima sila yakwe, adima wikazi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 16:18" />Kitugu chalongoela ubanangi, moyo wa kukeduvya walongoela kugwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 16:19" />Ni vedi kukeseleza na kunda hamwenga na wakiwa, kujink'ha kupangilana vitahigwa na wata lubezo.<verse eid="PRO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 16:20" />Yeyose akuzumila mahinizo naagendeele, naho yudya akumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu naavikilwe.<verse eid="PRO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 16:21" />Mta mzungu mo moyo etangwa mta umanyi, naho mbuli yedi yawelela want'hu vitendese.<verse eid="PRO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 16:22" />Mzungu ni n'choko yo ugima kwa wadya wananawo, mna mbwalasi egala usengelo kwa wabwalasi.<verse eid="PRO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 16:23" />Moyo wa mta mzungu wahiniza kulonga ayedi, naho aitenda milosi iyo iungiswe.<verse eid="PRO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 16:24" />Mbuli yedi ni enga kivuna, kina mwiile mwo moyo na kuwink'ha mwili ugima.<verse eid="PRO 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 16:25" />Mnt'hu adaha kuona sila yakwe ni yedi hameso hakwe, mna uheelo wakwe ni sila ya file.<verse eid="PRO 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 16:26" />Mndima mta sala adamanya ndima kwa kukombatiza, kwaviya sala yakwe yamtenda agendeele.<verse eid="PRO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 16:27" />Mnt'hu aihile anyanyika yaihile, yadya akulonga ni enga moto ukoka.<verse eid="PRO 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 16:28" />Mnt'hu mwiihi egala nk'humbizi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PRO 16:28">Mteti awapanga wambuya.<verse eid="PRO 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 16:29" />Mnt'hu mwiihi amluvya miyawe, na kumlongoza mwe zisila zihile.<verse eid="PRO 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 16:30" />Wakukonyeza meso yawe waunga wadamanye uwihi, wakugonjeza milomo yawe wakeika lumwe kudamanya uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 16:31" />Kunda na fii za udala ni taji yo ukulu, yapatikana kwa wikazi wa uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 16:32" />Heena maya ni ywedi kujink'ha yudya akuutaha umzi, akuuudaha moyo wakwe ni ywedi kujink'ha akuutaha mzi.<verse eid="PRO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 16:33" />Kula yatoigwa kwa kinyele, mna kila ulamuzi walawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PRO 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 17:1" />Ni vedi kudya mikate heina kint'hu kwa utondowazi, kujink'ha kudya fugo mwe nyumba ina kumbizi.<verse eid="PRO 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 17:2" />Mtumwa mta mzungu naaguhe hant'hu ha mwana mbwalasi wa mgoli, naapate hant'hu ha ukipe enga yumwenga mwe mp'huga iyo.<verse eid="PRO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 17:3" />Zahabu yedi hegu masawa yagezwa kwa moto, mna Zumbe Mnungu niye akuhima mioyo ya want'hu.<verse eid="PRO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 17:4" />Mnt'hu muihi ategeleza mbuli ziihile, mdant'hi ategeleza wadya wakulonga lulimi.<verse eid="PRO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 17:5" />Akumbela mkiwa kamjala Mnungu wakwe, akuionela kinyemi makunt'ho ya weyawe haaswese kusengelwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 17:6" />Wadala wakeduvila wezukulu wawe, wana nawo wakeduvila welesi wawe.<verse eid="PRO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 17:7" />Milosi yedi haikulongwa ni wabwalasi, iviyaiviya mbuli zo udant'hi zisekulongwa ni kilongozi.<verse eid="PRO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 17:8" />Want'hu waona yudya akulava matundu ya soni ni enga usai kwa uyo akuyalava, kila icho akudamanya mnt'hu chalaila enga ivo akuuga.<verse eid="PRO 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 17:9" />Kila uyo ukumuusila mbuyaye masa yakwe akuza lukunde, mna akuyakumbusa masa akeika hale na mbuyaye.<verse eid="PRO 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 17:10" />Kanyo dimwenga dya mnt'hu mta umanyi ni dyedi, kujink'ha makunt'ho gana kwa mnt'hu mhezi.<verse eid="PRO 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 17:11" />Want'hu wavu wakeika hale na Mnungu, mwigala ulosi heiina mbazi naatumwe kwawe.<verse eid="PRO 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 17:12" />Ni vedi kubwilana na kala vele dikwitangwa simba dihokigwe wanawe, kujink'ha kubwilana na mbwalasi mwo ubwalasi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 17:13" />Uneva mnt'hu naalihize yaihile kwa ayedi, yaihile hayauswe mwe nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 17:14" />Nk'hongelo ya kumbizi ni enga kuponk'hola mazi mwe dikawa, leka nk'humbizi umwo ikanda ikei kulaila.<verse eid="PRO 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 17:15" />Akugamba mta uwagilwa hana uwagilwa na yudya akugamba heiina uwagilwa ana uwagilwa, yose ayo maidi ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 17:16" />Nii wahezi wande na matundu yakulihila umanyi, mna uyo mwenye akulihilwa hakuunga kupata mzungu?<verse eid="PRO 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 17:17" />Mbuya ywa kindedi ni mhuwila mazuwa yose, ndugu kelekwa ambize mwo lupisi lwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 17:18" />Hiyo vedi kumkimaila miyawo kokukopa, na kumkimaila mnt'hu mtuhu.<verse eid="PRO 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 17:19" />Mnt'hu akuunga nk'humbizi aunga wavu, akuketogola akezunguila ubanangi.<verse eid="PRO 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 17:20" />Mta moyo mdala haapate ayedi, naho akulonga udant'hi naapate makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 17:21" />Akweleka mwana mbwalasi akegaila kinyulu mwenye, na tate ywo mwana mbwalasi hakudaha kunda na kinyemi.<verse eid="PRO 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 17:22" />Moyo usangale ni miti yedi, mna moyo una kinyulu wanyaza mavuha.<verse eid="PRO 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 17:23" />Mnt'hu mwavu ahokela matundu ya soni, vileke azaganye uwagilwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 17:24" />Mmanyi ukaula mzungu, mna mbwalasi aungisa kila kint'hu mwe isi.<verse eid="PRO 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 17:25" />Mwana mbwalasi egala kinyulu kwa ise, na usungu kwa nine amweleke.<verse eid="PRO 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 17:26" />Hiyo vedi kumsengela mnt'hu haheina masa, naho hiyo vedi kuwatowa heweina masa kwa uhuwilwa wawe.<verse eid="PRO 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 17:27" />Mnt'hu hekulongesa ana umanyi, naho mnt'hu mjalamu ni mta ubala.<verse eid="PRO 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 17:28" />Hata mbwalasi ananyamala aoneka ana mzungu, anagubika mnomo wakwe aoneka kunda mta umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 17:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PRO 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 18:1" />Mnt'hu akukeika hale na weyawe azungula mbuli zakwe mwenye, naho aihizwa akenk'higwa ulangilizi wowose wedi.<verse eid="PRO 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 18:2" />Mhezi hakuungisa umanyi, mna anda na kinyemi kubwelekeza fanyanyi zakwe mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 18:3" />Uwihi ukeza lubezo nalo lweza, hamwenga ne zisoni kweza ukuhuza.<verse eid="PRO 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 18:4" />Mbuli akulonga mnt'hu ni enga mazi matali ya bahali, ni enga nc'hoko kakuseleza kazuto ka mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 18:5" />Hiyo vedi kumwink'ha uwagilwa mnt'hu mwavu, na kumnyima uwagilwa mnt'hu mhuwila.<verse eid="PRO 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 18:6" />Yadya akulonga mbwalasi yegala nk'humbizi, naho kila icho akulonga chegala makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 18:7" />Mnomo wa mhezi wambananga mwenye, milosi yakwe ni mtego kwa moyo wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 18:8" />Mbuli ya mnt'hu msongezi ni enga nk'hande imwile, iyo ikuseela hamwenga kwe inda.<verse eid="PRO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 18:9" />Mnt'hu hekudamanya ndima, ni enga mbanangi.<verse eid="PRO 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 18:10" />Zina dya Zumbe Mnungu ni gomela ditogile, wata uwagilwa wadigulukila wasekupatwa ni maihi.<verse eid="PRO 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 18:11" />Fanyanyi za want'hu wagoli ni kugamba ugoli wawe wawadima enga gomela dyawe ditogile dikuzunguluka mzi.<verse eid="PRO 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 18:12" />Mta moyo wa wefenyi wegala ubanangi, mna kukeseleza kwegala nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 18:13" />Yehe akuhitula umwo akanda akei kutegeleza, uyo ni uhezi naho ni mbuli ya soni.<verse eid="PRO 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 18:14" />Muye wo mnt'hu wadaha kufinyiliza unyonge, mna uneva moyo ufa chevu wadaha vivihi kufinyiliza?<verse eid="PRO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 18:15" />Mnt'hu mta ubala akegaila umanyi, magutwi ya mta mzungu uzungula umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 18:16" />Geleko dyamkomoela sila yudya akulava, nadyo dyamwigala mnt'hu ha wakulu.<verse eid="PRO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 18:17" />Ywa nk'hongo kwe kitala naaoneke kunda mkindedi, mpaka yudya akumhiga akonge kumuuza mbuli.<verse eid="PRO 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 18:18" />Kutowa kula kwabinda uhigani, kwalava ulamuzi mwa wakulu wakuhigana.<verse eid="PRO 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 18:19" />Ndugu aihizwe ni mdala kuzumila kulamulwa kujink'ha mzi wa gomela, naho yudya akuhigana ni enga nk'hili ivugalwe na madanga.<verse eid="PRO 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 18:20" />Milosi yedi ya mzungu yamtende mnt'hu egute, neegute ulozo uwo ukulawa mwe milomo yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 18:21" />File no ugima vi mwo udahi wo lulimi lwa mnt'hu, nawo wakuunga kuudamanyila ndima nawadye matunda yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 18:22" />Akupata mkaziwe apata kint'hu chedi, naye apata geleko dyedi kulawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 18:23" />Mnt'hu mkiwa alombeza kwa kukeseleza, mna mgoli ahitula kwa luhahila.<verse eid="PRO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 18:24" />Mnt'hu mta wambuya wengi wadaha kumbananga, mna weyuko wambuya wahuwila kujink'ha ndugu.<verse eid="PRO 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PRO 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 19:1" />Ni vedi mkiwa akwikala kwa uhuwilwa, kujink'ha mnt'hu mhezi uyo milomo yakwe ikulonga udant'hi.<verse eid="PRO 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 19:2" />Naho hiyo vedi kwa mnt'hu kukombeka haheina umanyi, naho akusunguza naakobadike.<verse eid="PRO 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 19:3" />Mnt'hu anakebanaga kwa uhezi wakwe, moyo wakwe wamuihiya Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 19:4" />Ugoli wegala wambuya wengi, mna mkiwa alekwa na wambwiyaze wa hagihi.<verse eid="PRO 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 19:5" />Muwona mdant'hi haaswese kusengelwa, naye akulonga udant'hi haalekelwe du.<verse eid="PRO 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 19:6" />Want'hu wengi wakehembeleza kwa wakulu, na kila yumwenga ni mbuya ywa mnt'hu akulava geleko.<verse eid="PRO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 19:7" />Mnt'hu mkiwa aihiwa ni wanduguze, wambuyaze nawo wakeika hale naye, hata anawetanga haawaone.<verse eid="PRO 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 19:8" />Akupata mzungu auungisa moyo wakwe mwenye, akuzumila umanyi naapate yedi.<verse eid="PRO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 19:9" />Muwona mdant'hi haaswese kusengelwa, naye akulonga lulimi naabanangwe.<verse eid="PRO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 19:10" />Havikuwagila mhezi ekale mwo wikazi wedi, naho hevinde vedi kwa mtumwa kuwalongoza wakulu.<verse eid="PRO 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 19:11" />Mzungu wa mnt'hu wamwink'ha kufinyiliza, naho ukulu kwakwe ni kuwausila want'hu masa yawe.<verse eid="PRO 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 19:12" />Maya ya seuta ni enga simba ikubuma, mna uwedi wakwe ni enga mnyuzu mwa mani.<verse eid="PRO 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 19:13" />Mwana mhezi ni ubanangi kwa ise, naho nk'humbizi ya mvele ni enga fula ikunya heikusila.<verse eid="PRO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 19:14" />Nyumba na ugoli ni ukipe akupata mnt'hu kulawa kwa welesi wakwe, mna mvele mta mzungu alawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 19:15" />Usokezi wamgela mnt'hu mwe zint'hongo, naye mnt'hu msokezi naaone sala.<verse eid="PRO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 19:16" />Akutimila sigilizi auika vedi ugima wakwe, mna yehe akubela sila zakwe naabanike.<verse eid="PRO 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 19:17" />Akumwambiza mkiwa amkopesha Zumbe Mnungu, Zumbe Mnungu naamlihe kwa udamanyi wakwe wedi.<verse eid="PRO 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 19:18" />Muogole mwanao kukei kukanda kuna kawiilo, mna sema unamtowe niyo abanika.<verse eid="PRO 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 19:19" />Mnt'hu mta maya yatendese naapate makunt'ho, uneva unamuyokola vaungwa udamanye ivo kaidi.<verse eid="PRO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 19:20" />Tegeleza ulangilizi naho uhokele mahinizo, upate kunda no mzungu mwa mazuwa yako yakwiza.<verse eid="PRO 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 19:21" />Kuna mbuli nyingi mwo moyo wa mnt'hu, mna kiya akuunga akidamanye Zumbe Mnungu nicho nekinde.<verse eid="PRO 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 19:22" />Icho kikuungigwa kwa mnt'hu ni lukunde lwa ulo na ulo, nevinde vedi kwa mnt'hu mkiwa kujink'ha mnt'hu mdant'hi.<verse eid="PRO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 19:23" />Kumvika Zumbe Mnungu kwegala ugima, naho mnt'hu naahumule akanda kakint'ha, haheina kunda na masulumizo.<verse eid="PRO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 19:24" />Mnt'hu msokezi ni enga mnt'hu akugela mkono wakwe mwo lwiga lwe nk'hande, mna hakudaha hata kuvuza mwo mnomo wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 19:25" />Msengele mta utani na mbwalasi naapate ubala, mkanye mta mzungu naye naapate umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 19:26" />Akumbaila ise na kumgulusa nine, ni mwana akugela soni na lubezo.<verse eid="PRO 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 19:27" />Mwanangu unaleka kutegeleza mahinizo, nowage hale ne mbuli yo umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 19:28" />Muwona akuguha matundu ya soni atanila kitala, na mnomo wa mnt'hu mwavu wamela wiihi.<verse eid="PRO 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 19:29" />Usengelo uikwa kwa wadya wakutana, ngoda ziikwa kwa kuwatowela wahezi.<verse eid="PRO 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PRO 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 20:1" />Divai yagela lubezo, p'hombe nayo yagela nk'humbizi, akuzaganywa ni ayo kaswesa mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 20:2" />Maya ya seuta ni enga simba ikubuma, akumgela maya, ahosa wikazi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 20:3" />Ni mbuli ye nt'hunyo mnt'hu kukeika hale na nk'humbizi, mna wahezi nawo wakuungisa nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 20:4" />Mnt'hu msokezi hakuunga kulima mwo lupisi lwa kahanda, ivo mwo lupisi lwa uvuni naazungule mna haapate chochose.<verse eid="PRO 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 20:5" />Fanyanyi za mnt'hu zikefisa enga mazi matali, mna mta umanyi ayateka.<verse eid="PRO 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 20:6" />Want'hu wengi wakeduvya kunda wedi, mna mhuwilwa ni ani akudaha kumpata?<verse eid="PRO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 20:7" />Mnt'hu mta uwagilwa ekala wikazi houna uwihi, hata wanawe naawaleke nawavikilwe.<verse eid="PRO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 20:8" />Seuta anekala mwe difumbi dyakwe dyo usengelo, aukombaganya uwihi wose kwa meso yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 20:9" />Ni ani akudaha kugamba hikekukiza moyo wangu, miye ni ywedi naho hina wavu?<verse eid="PRO 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 20:10" />Mizani yo udant'hi ne vihimo vo udant'hi, vose ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 20:11" />Hata mwana amanyika kwa udamanyi wakwe, uneva udamanyi wakwe ni wedi na uhuwila.<verse eid="PRO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 20:12" />Magutwi yakwiva na meso yakuona, Zumbe Mnungu niye ayadamanye yose maidi.<verse eid="PRO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 20:13" />Usekuungisa nt'hongo sema unande mkiwa, unde meso nawe nounde ne nk'hande nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 20:14" />Mguzi agamba hiyo yedi, hiyo yedi, mna anahalawa akeduvya kwa kuhunguzilwa diyombe.<verse eid="PRO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 20:15" />Kuna zahabu na maiwe mengi ya yombe kulu, mna milomo ikulonga mizungu nicho kint'hu cha yombe kulu.<verse eid="PRO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 20:16" />Mnt'hu analaganila hako kumkimaila mtakwiza guha suke yakwe, uyo niye namlihile uyo mtakwiza.<verse eid="PRO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 20:17" />Nk'hande ikupatikana kwa udant'hi imwile kwa mnt'hu, mna akajika yanda enga msanga mwo mnomo.<verse eid="PRO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 20:18" />Kila mbuli yedi yadamanyika kwa ulangilizi, unaunga kukonga kutowana nk'hondo zungula ulangilizi.<verse eid="PRO 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 20:19" />Mlulimi akufisa mbuli za kinyele, ivo usekumtimila mnt'hu akulonga uhezi.<verse eid="PRO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 20:20" />Akumligita ise hegu nine, ung'azi wo ugima wakwe nouzimwe enga lumuli mwe diziza dititihale.<verse eid="PRO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 20:21" />Ukipe usunguze kupatikana, hounde no uvikilwa ko uheelo.<verse eid="PRO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 20:22" />Usekugamba, nenilihe uwihi nidamanyilwe. Mgojele Zumbe Mnungu naye naakuyokole.<verse eid="PRO 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 20:23" />Zumbe aihizwa vitendese na maiwe ya kuhimila yo udant'hi, vihimo vo ubavi havikumwelela.<verse eid="PRO 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 20:24" />Lugendo lwa mnt'hu lwadimwa ni Zumbe Mnungu, adaha vivihi mnt'hu kumanya sila yakwe mwenye?<verse eid="PRO 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 20:25" />Ni mtego kwa mnt'hu kulagana kulava kint'hu kwa Zumbe Mnungu naho akajika kufanyanya naho kiya alagane.<verse eid="PRO 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 20:26" />Seuta mta mzungu awakombaganya waihi, awasengela haheina mbazi.<verse eid="PRO 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 20:27" />Muye wa mnt'hu ni lumuli lwa Zumbe Mnungu, ayapelemba yose yakefisile mndani mwakwe.<verse eid="PRO 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 20:28" />Lukunde no uhuwilwa lwamuika seuta hant'hu hedi, kwa sila ya lukunde fumbi dyakwe useuta dyanda na utondowazi.<verse eid="PRO 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 20:29" />Weduvi wa wabwanga ni ludole lwawe, naho nt'hunyo ya wadala ni fii zina mizungu. <verse eid="PRO 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 20:30" />Mishenge ikuluma nuwo mti wa kuusa uwihi, milumile ya kufyalikwa yautenda umoyo unde wedi.<verse eid="PRO 20:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PRO 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 21:1" />Moyo wa seuta u mwe udahi wa Zumbe Mnungu, aulongoza enga kazuto kakuseleza mazi hohose hadya akuunga.<verse eid="PRO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 21:2" />Udamanyi wa mnt'hu waoneka kuligana ha meso hakwe, mna Zumbe Mnungu aihima mioyo.<verse eid="PRO 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 21:3" />Kudamanya mbuli yedi ya uwagilwa, yamwelela Zumbe Mnungu kujink'ha nt'hambiko.<verse eid="PRO 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 21:4" />Mta moyo mdala na wa kukeduvya, walagisa pwilili wavu wa waihi.<verse eid="PRO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 21:5" />Minyanyiko ya mta kukombatiza yegala ugoli mwingi, mna kila mta kipump'ha aheela ukiwa.<verse eid="PRO 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 21:6" />Ugoli ukupatikana kwa udant'hi, ni enga mosi ukomboka naho ni mtego we file.<verse eid="PRO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 21:7" />Kitugu cha waihi nekiwabanange, kwaviya walemela kudamanya ayedi.<verse eid="PRO 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 21:8" />Sila ya mta masa yaga, mna lugendo lwa mnt'hu hahena masa ni lwedi.<verse eid="PRO 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 21:9" />Ni vedi kwikala mnk'handa mwe digulu he nyumba, kujink'ha kwikala mwe nyumba imwenga na mvele mta nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 21:10" />Mnt'hu mwavu aungisa uwihi, hata kwa mbuyaye hakuona mbazi.<verse eid="PRO 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 21:11" />Unamsengela mta utani, mbwalasi apata mzungu, unamhiniza mta mzungu wamwink'ha umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 21:12" />Mta uwagilwa ayamanya yadya yakudamanywa mwe zinyumba za waihi, naye naawabange waihi.<verse eid="PRO 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 21:13" />Akulemela kutegeleza ndilo ya wakiwa, naye haategelezwe umwo akazungula wambizi.<verse eid="PRO 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 21:14" />Geleko dikulavigwa kwa kinyele dyahausa maya, naho matundu ya soni yafisigwe mwe suke yahoza maya.<verse eid="PRO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 21:15" />Umwo uwagilwa unadamanyika kwa uwedi wagela kinyemi kwa wata uwagilwa, mna ni uhuza kwa awo wakudamanya uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 21:16" />Mnt'hu akwaga kulawa mwe sila yo umanyi, naahumule mwe fyo dya wabanike.<verse eid="PRO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 21:17" />Mnt'hu akuungisa vint'hu vikumunk'hilwa naande mkiwa, yoyose akuungisa kudya kwa uhank'hu haande mgoli.<verse eid="PRO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 21:18" />Waihi nawapate masulumizo heyekuwapata wawagilwa, hewekuhuwila nawasulumizwe hant'hu ha wahuwila.<verse eid="PRO 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 21:19" />Ni vedi kwikala kwe dijangwa, kujink'ha kwikala na mvele mta nk'humbizi na mkalalizi.<verse eid="PRO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 21:20" />Mwe nyumba ya mta mzungu kuna kindolo che nk'hande yedi na mavuta, mna mnt'hu mhezi adya kihunt'he.<verse eid="PRO 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 21:21" />Yehe akuutimila uwagilwa na lukunde, naapate ugima na upati na nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 21:22" />Mnt'hu mta mzungu adaha kuukup'hukila mzi una ludole na kugwesa magomela wakuyahuwila.<verse eid="PRO 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 21:23" />Akwamila mnomo wakwe na lulimi lwakwe, akeika hale no uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 21:24" />Mnt'hu mta moyo mdala na kukeduvya, lubezo nidyo dizina dyakwe, udamanyi wakwe umema wefenyi na udala wo moyo wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 21:25" />Kumunk'hiswa kwa msokezi niyo file yakwe, kwaviya mikono yakwe haikuungisa kudamanya ndima.<verse eid="PRO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 21:26" />Msi wose mwavu amunk'hilwa kupata kint'hu, mna mhuwila alava kwa ukise.<verse eid="PRO 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 21:27" />Nt'hambiko ya mnt'hu mwavu ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Mnungu, yaihiza vitendese akailava kwa utondwe.<verse eid="PRO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 21:28" />Muwona mdant'hi naage, mna milosi ya mta akwiva ya kindedi naagendeele.<verse eid="PRO 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 21:29" />Mnt'hu mwavu akelagisa kunda katoga, mna mnt'hu mhuwilwa azifanyanya sila zakwe.<verse eid="PRO 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 21:30" />Hahana mzungu hegu umanyi hegu mbuli yedi yoyose ya mnt'hu, ikudaha kuhigana na Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 21:31" />Wadaha kuika lumwe falasi kwa nk'hondo, mna uhumi walawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 21:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PRO 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 22:1" />Ni vedi kunda ne nt'hogola yedi kujink'ha ugoli mwingi, nt'hunyo ni yedi kujink'ha masawa na zahabu.<verse eid="PRO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 22:2" />Mgoli na mkiwa waliganywa mwe kint'hu kimwenga, Zumbe Mnungu ni muumbi ywa wose.<verse eid="PRO 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 22:3" />Mnt'hu mta wengele ayaona yaihile na kukefisa, mna wahezi wagendeela kulongole enga mant'hunt'hu niyo walumila.<verse eid="PRO 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 22:4" />Kukeseleza na kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, kwegala ugoli, nt'hunyo no ugima.<verse eid="PRO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 22:5" />Sila ya waihi imema miwa na mitego, mna yehe akuwamila moyo wakwe naande hale nayo.<verse eid="PRO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 22:6" />Mhinize mwana sila ya wikazi wedi, naye haileke mpaka mwo udala wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 22:7" />Mgoli amwikaila mkiwa, naye akukopa ni mtumwa kwa yudya akumkopesha.<verse eid="PRO 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 22:8" />Yehe akuhanda uwihi naavune masulumizo, udahi wakwe wa kudamanya uwihi noubanangwe.<verse eid="PRO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 22:9" />Mnt'hu mkise naavikilwe, kwaviya nk'hande yakwe awapangila wakiwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 22:10" />Mguluse mta lubezo na k'humbizi vihalawe, nk'humbizi na kuhomola nevihalawe.<verse eid="PRO 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 22:11" />Mta moyo wedi na milosi yedi, naande mbuya ywa seuta.<verse eid="PRO 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 22:12" />Zumbe Mnungu amwamila mta umanyi we kindedi, mna ahiga mbuli za mnt'hu hiyo mhuwila.<verse eid="PRO 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 22:13" />Msokezi agamba kuna simba kuse, naho niyo agamba neinikome mwe sila.<verse eid="PRO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 22:14" />Mnomo wa pamp'he ni bome tali, aihiwe ni Zumbe Mnungu neingile umo.<verse eid="PRO 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 22:15" />Mwana aungisa mbuli za kihezi mwo moyo wakwe, mna ngoda ya makanyo neimuike hale naye.<verse eid="PRO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngelo milongo mitatu ya wata umanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 22:16" />Akumhujila mkiwa vileke akegenyezele ugoli wakwe, naye akumwink'ha mgoli geleko, wose nawande wakiwa<verse eid="PRO 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milosi milongo mitatu ya wa wata mizungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 22:17" />Tegeleza mbuli za wata mzungu, uike moyo wako utimile mahinizo yangu, <verse eid="PRO 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 22:18" />kwaviya weye nounde na kinyemi umwo unayaika mwo moyo wako, na kuyalonga kila lupisi. <verse eid="PRO 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 22:19" />Uyo huunga nimhinize dielo ni weye, vileke kawiilo dyako dinde kwa Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="PRO 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 22:20" />Hikuwandikila milosi milongo mitatu, ya makanyo na ulangilizi wedi, <verse eid="PRO 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 22:21" />vileke huhinize mbuli ziligane ne kindedi, naho mnt'hu anakuuza udahe kumwink'ha uhituzi.<verse eid="PRO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa nk'hongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 22:22" />Usekumhoka mkiwa kwaviya ni mkiwa, naho use kumnyima mkiwa uwagilwa wakwe mwe kitala, <verse eid="PRO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 22:23" />kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu naawagombele, naye naawahoke ugima wawe wadya wakuunga wawahujileni.<verse eid="PRO 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa kaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 22:24" />Usekutenda umbuya na mnt'hu mta maya, hegu usekunda na uhamwenga na mta maya, <verse eid="PRO 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 22:25" />unase kukehiniza zinyendo zakwe, na kukeika mwenye mwo mtego.<verse eid="PRO 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa katatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 22:26" />Usekunda yumwenga ywawe wakuika lagano, hegu wakukimaila wakutigizwa, <verse eid="PRO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 22:27" />uneva huna chochose cho kuliha, hata lusazi lwako lwa kugonela nekiguhigwe ukanda kukigonela.<verse eid="PRO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa kane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 22:28" />Usekuusa kilagiso che mihaka ya kale, iyo yaikagwa ni wakale wako.<verse eid="PRO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa shano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 22:29" />Togola eyuko mnt'hu mta umanyi mwe zindima zakwe? Uyo naawadamnyile ndima wakulu, haawadamanyile ndima want'hu heweina nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 22:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PRO 23" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mtandatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 23:1" />Unekala no kudya nk'hande hamwenga na kilongozi, ukaulise kugamba una kilongozi, <verse eid="PRO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 23:2" />usekuungisa ukudya, uneva weye wi mhank'hu, <verse eid="PRO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 23:3" />usekuungisa nk'hande zakwe zedi, kwaviya nk'hande izo ni za nyambi.<verse eid="PRO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 23:4" />Uneva una mzungu ukint'hile, usekwangadika kuzungula ugoli, <verse eid="PRO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 23:5" />kufinya na kugubula ugoli wahalawa, vanda enga upata mawawa.<verse eid="PRO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mnane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 23:6" />Usekudya nk'hande ya mnt'hu mgila, usekuungisa nk'hande zakwe zo kumunk'hilwa, <verse eid="PRO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 23:7" />kwaviya mwo umoyo wakwe awaza icho adile, Naakugambile, “Dya naho nywa.” Mna mwo moyo wakwe hehamwenga nawe. <verse eid="PRO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 23:8" />Noutahike kiya udile, naho milosi yako ya kumtogola neinde kuyaza haheina kint'hu.<verse eid="PRO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa kenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 23:9" />Usekulonga mbuli yako ha mhezi, kwaviya naabele mzungu we zimbuli zako.<verse eid="PRO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 23:10" />Usekuusa kiwalo mwo mhaka wa kale, naho usekwingila mwe zink'honde za wana nk'hiwa, <verse eid="PRO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 23:11" />kwaviya Mnungu Mkombola ni mta udahi, naye naaugombele uwagilwa wawe kulawa mwako.<verse eid="PRO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na imwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 23:12" />Timila moyo wako utegeleze mahinizo, na magutwi yako utegeleze umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na mbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 23:13" />Usekuleka kumkanya mwana, kwaviya unamkanya kwa mshenge haabanike, <verse eid="PRO 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 23:14" />unamkanya kwa mshenge, nauyokole wikazi wakwe kulawa ko mnyongomela.<verse eid="PRO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na nt'hatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 23:15" />Mwanangu uneva moyo wako una mzungu, ivo moyo wangu noundilise ne kinyemi, <verse eid="PRO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 23:16" />moyo wangu nowange, umwo mnomo wako unalonga mbuli zo uwagilwa.<verse eid="PRO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na kane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 23:17" />Moyo wako usekuwaonela finju wata wavu, mna gendeela kumvika Zumbe Mnungu mazuwa yose, <verse eid="PRO 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 23:18" />kindedi kuna kawiilo mwo mazuwa yakwiza kwajili yako, naho kawiilo dyako hedilemelwe.<verse eid="PRO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na shano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 23:19" />Tegeleza mwanangu unde no mzungu, ika moyo wako mwe sila yo uwagilwa, <verse eid="PRO 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 23:20" />usekunda yumwenga mwa awo wakukolwa, hegu wahank'hu wakuungisa nyama, <verse eid="PRO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 23:21" />kwaviya wakukolwa na wahank'hu nawande wakiwa, wasokezi nawavale suke zisakale.<verse eid="PRO 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na mtandatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 23:22" />Mtegeleze iso, naho usekumbela nyokwe umwo ananda kadalahala, <verse eid="PRO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 23:23" />gula ukindedi naho usekuutaga, pata mzungu na mahinizo no umanyi, <verse eid="PRO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 23:24" />ise dya mta uwagilwa ana kinyemi kikulu, naye amweleke mwana mta mzungu naande na kinyemi, <verse eid="PRO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 23:25" />welesi wako nawande ne kinyemi, nyokwe akweleke ange.<verse eid="PRO 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na mgungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 23:26" />Mwanangu nitegeleze kwa wengele, utimile nyendo zo wikazi wangu, <verse eid="PRO 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 23:27" />kwaviya pamp'he ni bome tali, na mvele mtakwiza ni enga sima finyu, <verse eid="PRO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 23:28" />yehe anyatila enga mbavi, niye akuwatenda wagosi wengi wasekunda wahuwilwa.<verse eid="PRO 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na mnane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 23:29" />Ni ani akugutila? Ni ani mta kinyulu? Ni ani mta nk'humbizi? Ni ani wakulabila? Ni ani alumizwe hahena kudamanya mbuli yoyose? Niani wata meso yenk'hundu? <verse eid="PRO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 23:30" />Ni wadya wakwikala hakunywegwa mp'hombe, awo wakugenda kuzungula divai ihanganywe. <verse eid="PRO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 23:31" />Usekuiungisa divai hata uneva ink'hundu, hata uneva yamelemeta mwe kikombe, na kuseela mp'halahole umwo ukainywa. <verse eid="PRO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 23:32" />Mwo uheelo yaluma enga nyoka, yoka enga satu dina usungu. <verse eid="PRO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 23:33" />Meso yako nayaone maluwe luwe, moyo wako nao noulave mbuli zagile. <verse eid="PRO 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 23:34" />Nounde enga mnt'hu akugona hagatigati ye bahali, hegu enga mnt'hu akugona mnanga ye meli. <verse eid="PRO 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 23:35" />Nougambe, Wanitowa mna hilumile, wanitowa mna hivile, Neninuke ini, vileke nikolwe naho?<verse eid="PRO 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PRO 24" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa mlongo na kenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 24:1" />Usekuwaonela wivu want'hu waihile, naho usekuungisa kunda hamwenga nawo, <verse eid="PRO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 24:2" />kwaviya mioyo yawe yafanyanya mbuli zo lubezo, na milomo yawe yalonga mbuli ziihile.<verse eid="PRO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 24:3" />Nyumba yazengwa kwa mzungu, naho kwa sila yo umanyi yatoga. <verse eid="PRO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 24:4" />Kwa sila yo umanyi vyumba vakwe vamemezwa, vint'hu va yombe na va kuwagila.<verse eid="PRO 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na imwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 24:5" />Mnt'hu mta mzungu ana udahi mkulu, mnt'hu mta umanyi naye ana ludole; <verse eid="PRO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 24:6" />Kwaviya kutowana nk'hondo kwaunga ulongozi, na kwa walangilizi wengi uhumi wapatikana.<verse eid="PRO 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na mbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 24:7" />Kwa mhezi, mzungu ni mdala kuumanya, mwo mdugano hana dyodyose dyo kulonga.<verse eid="PRO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na nt'hatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 24:8" />Mnt'hu akufanyanya kudamanya yaihile, naamanyike enga mnt'hu wa nyambi. <verse eid="PRO 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 24:9" />Fanyanyi za mhezi ni wavu, mta lubezo aihizwa na kila mnt'hu.<verse eid="PRO 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na kane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 24:10" />Unafachevu mwo lupisi lwa makunt'ho, weye kuswesa ludole.<verse eid="PRO 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na shano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 24:11" />Myokole mnt'hu akukomigwa heebanange kint'hu, kombeka kumyokola akukomwa. <verse eid="PRO 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 24:12" />Wadaha kugamba weye huyamanyize, mna Mnungu kamanya naho asengela lugendo lwako. Naho yehe akukaulisa, naho kamanya, ivo naakulihe viligane na ivo ukudamanya.<verse eid="PRO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na mtandatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 24:13" />Mwanangu udye uki kwaviya ni wedi, naho kivuna kina mwiile mwo mnomo, <verse eid="PRO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 24:14" />ivi nivo wili mzungu unamwiile mwo moyo wako, uneva kuupata nounde na kawiilo mwa mazuwa yakwiza, naho kawiilo dyako hedinde enga ivo wili.<verse eid="PRO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 24:15" />Usekunyatila enga mwavu akukump'hukila hant'hu ha mnt'hu ywedi, naho usekugeza kuibananga nyumba yakwe, <verse eid="PRO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 24:16" />kwaviya mnt'hu muwagilwa agwa nk'hanana nyingi na kwinuka mna mnt'hu mwavu abanangwa na yaihile.<verse eid="PRO 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na mnane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 24:17" />Usekwanga kugwa kwa mnk'hondo ywako, naho usekunda ne kinyemi mwo moyo wako umwo anagwa, <verse eid="PRO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 24:18" />kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu anayaona ayo helelwe, adaha kuleka kumsulumiza.<verse eid="PRO 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo miidi na kenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 24:19" />Usekuihiya kwajili ya want'hu waihile, naho usekuwaonela wivu waihi, <verse eid="PRO 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 24:20" />kwaviya mnt'hu mwihi haapate kawiilo mwa mazuwa yakwiza, naho lumuli lwo ugima wakwe noluhauswe.<verse eid="PRO 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa milongo mitatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 24:21" />Mwanangu mvike Zumbe Mnungu na komwogoha seuta, naho usekunda na uhamwenga na want'hu wasaguke, <verse eid="PRO 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 24:22" />kwaviya ubanangi wawe nouwalawile kipump'ha, naho ni ani akumanya maihi yakudaha kuhoswa ni seuta?<verse eid="PRO 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milosi mit'huhu ya wata mizungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 24:23" />Iviya iviya ikutimila ni milosi ya wata mizungu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PRO 24:23">kwazagula kwa want'hu mwo usengeelo hiyo vedi. <verse eid="PRO 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 24:24" />Yeyose akumgamba mta masa, hana masa, want'hu nawamligite naho si neimwiihiye. <verse eid="PRO 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 24:25" />Mna wakuwasengela waihi nawapate kinyemi, naho uvikilwa nouwazile.<verse eid="PRO 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 24:26" />Uhituzi wa uwagilwa, ni kilagiso cha lukunde lwa kindedi.<verse eid="PRO 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 24:27" />Bindiliza ndima zako za kuse, ziike lumwe nk'honde zako akajika izenge nyumba yako.<verse eid="PRO 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 24:28" />Usekulava uwona wo udant'hi kwa miyao hegu kulonga lulimi mwa yehe. <verse eid="PRO 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 24:29" />Usekulonga, “Nenimtendele enga ivo anitendele miye! Nenimlihe mnt'hu yudya kwa kiya anitendele!”<verse eid="PRO 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 24:30" />Nombokaga hagihi ne nk'honde ya msokezi, hagihi ne nk'honde ya mizabibu ya mnt'hu mhezi. <verse eid="PRO 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 24:31" />Nelelagwa kuona miwa mingi, mani yagubikaga hant'hu aho hose, na lukandula lwakwe lwa maiwe lwamokaga. <verse eid="PRO 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 24:32" />Nakaulaga niyo nafanyanya yadya yalaile, name niyo napata kukehiniza kwa yadya niyaone. <verse eid="PRO 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 24:33" />Ukagamba ugone ludodo, na kukupila ludodo, na kuhumula, <verse eid="PRO 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 24:34" />umanyage kugamba unatenda ivo, ukiwa noukwizile enga mbavi, noukukump'hukile enga mhoki mta vitowanilo.<verse eid="PRO 24:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PRO 25" />
  <para style="s">Ngelo nt'huhu za Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 25:1" />Izi nizo ngelo nt'huhu za seuta Selemani zawandikagwa ni want'hu wa Hezekia, seuta ywa Yuda.<verse eid="PRO 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 25:2" />Ni ukulu wa Mnungu kufisa mbuli, mna ni ukulu wa seuta kuzibunk'hula zimbuli.<verse eid="PRO 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 25:3" />Enga mbingu ivo zi hale ne isi, nivo ili mioyo ya maseuta haikudahika kupelemba.<verse eid="PRO 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 25:4" />Hausa viputiputi mwe madini ya masawa, naho msani naakudamanyile kint'hu chedi.<verse eid="PRO 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 25:5" />Wahause waihi ha seuta, niho ulongozi wakwe noutoge kwa sila ya uwagilwa.<verse eid="PRO 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 25:6" />Use kukekweza mwenye ha seuta, hegu usekuketenda mnt'hu mkulu, <verse eid="PRO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 25:7" />kwaviya vaungwa ute kwitangwa, kujink'ha kugeligwa soni ha mkulu kwa kiya ukione.<verse eid="PRO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 25:8" />Usekusunguza kwigala kwe kitala mbuli uiyone. Uneva muona mtuhu aneza kugamba huna kindedi, weye noutende vivihi?<verse eid="PRO 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 25:9" />Uneva unadamanya ulangilizi na mbuyayo, kila yumwenga ywenyu asekulava kinyele cha miyawe. <verse eid="PRO 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 25:10" />Want'hu wasekumanya huna kinyele, niyo wakebanangila zina dyako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PRO 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 25:11" />Mbuli ikulonga mwo lupisi uwo kinanalwo, ni enga zahabu ihambigwe mnanga mwe madini ya masawa.<verse eid="PRO 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 25:12" />Makanyo ya mta mzungu kwa mnt'hu akutegeleza, ni yedi kujink'ha mp'hete hegu vint'hu va zahabu yedi.<verse eid="PRO 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 25:13" />Enga mp'heho ya seluji mwo lupisi lwo uvuni, nivo eli mwigala ulosi mhuwilwa kwa wadya wakumlagiza, kwaviya awenk'ha kinyemi wakulu wakwe mwe mioyo yawe.<verse eid="PRO 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 25:14" />Enga viya mavunde ne nk'hung'nt'ho haheyeina fula, nivo eli mnt'hu akukeduvya kwa nt'hunyo izo akuzilava.<verse eid="PRO 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 25:15" />Kwa kufinyiliza kilongozi adaha kunda mhufu, lulimi lwadaha kutula mavuha.<verse eid="PRO 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 25:16" />Uneva unaubwila uki dya kwa kukint'ha, Unagendeela kuudya kwa uhank'hu wadaha utahike. <verse eid="PRO 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 25:17" />Usekumtalamkila miyao nk'hanana nyingi, sema anakusokele niyo akuihia.<verse eid="PRO 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 25:18" />Mnt'hu akulava uwona wa udant'hi mwa miyawe, ni enga lungu na sime hegu msale.<verse eid="PRO 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 25:19" />Kumkawiila mnt'hu hiyo mhuwilwa mwo lupisi lwa makunt'ho, ni enga zino dikuluma hegu kiga kivunike.<verse eid="PRO 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 25:20" />Akukema wila kwa mnt'hu mta kinyulu, ni enga kuhambula suke mwo lupisi lwa mp'heho, hegu kugela mazi ya limao mwe nk'hwenge.<verse eid="PRO 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 25:21" />Mnk'hondo ywako ananda na sala mwink'he nk'hande, akanda ne nk'hilu mwink'he mazi anywe,<verse eid="PRO 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 25:22" />kwa kudamanya ivo, noumtende ande na soni, enga makala ya moto mwo mtwi wakwe, Zumbe Mnungu nae naakwink'he nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 25:23" />Enga mp'heho ya mkomamahanya ivo ikwigala fula, iviya iviya akulonga udant'hi kwegala maya.<verse eid="PRO 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 25:24" />Ni vedi kwikala mnk'handa mwe digulu dye nyumba, kujink'ha kwikala mwe nyumba imwenga na mvele mta nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 25:25" />Enga viya mazi ye mp'heho kwa mta nk'hilu, nivo ili mbuli yedi kulawa isi ya hale.<verse eid="PRO 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 25:26" />Mhuwilwa akuzumila kutimila mbuli yo mwihi, ni enga n'choko ingeligwe nt'hagata hegu sima ditibulwe.<verse eid="PRO 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 25:27" />Hivo vedi kudya uki mwingi, naho hiyo vedi kukezungila nt'hunyo yako mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 25:28" />Uneva hukuyadaha maya yako, huna wambizi enga mzi hewiina gomela, una uhufu mwo kukump'hukilwa.<verse eid="PRO 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PRO 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 26:1" />Enga balafu mwo lupisi lwa zuwa hegu fula mwo lupisi lwa ulozo, nivo vili kwa mhezi kwink'higwa nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 26:2" />Enga chole mwo kwangadika kwakwe, hegu mbayuwayu mwo kupuluka kwakwe, ivi nivo dili ligito hadikudaha kumpata mnt'hu heheina masa.<verse eid="PRO 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 26:3" />Mkotya kwa falasi, lijamu kwa mp'hunda, ngoda nayo kwa mgongo wa mhezi.<verse eid="PRO 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 26:4" />Use kumhitula mhezi viligane no uhezi wakwe, sema unande enga yehe.<verse eid="PRO 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 26:5" />Mhitule mhezi viligane na uhezi wakwe, sema akakeona kunda mta mzungu ho undiilo wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 26:6" />Akwigala ulosi kwa mkono wa mhezi ni enga kukesenga viga hegu kukezunguila makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 26:7" />Enga viga va mnt'hu aholomp'hale, nivo ili ngelo mwo mnomo wa mhezi.<verse eid="PRO 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 26:8" />Kumwink'ha mhezi nt'hunyo ni enga kuika iwe mwe nk'humbaiwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 26:9" />Enga mnt'hu akoligwe akugeza kuulava mwiwa mwo mkono wakwe, nivo ili ngelo mwo mnomo wa mhezi.<verse eid="PRO 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 26:10" />Mnt'hu amwink'hile ndima mhezi hegu mnt'hu akukolwa, ni enga akulasa akalumiza kila mnt'hu.<verse eid="PRO 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 26:11" />Mhezi akuuhiya mhezi wakwe ni enga kuli dikudya matahika yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 26:12" />Mhezi atendese ana kawiilo kujink'ha wose wakukeona kunda na mizungu mna kumbeche hawana nayo.<verse eid="PRO 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 26:13" />Mnt'hu msokezi agamba, “Uko kuse iyuko simba, miye hikudaha kuita uko!”<verse eid="PRO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 26:14" />Enga ivo lwivi lukuzunguluka mwe zibawaba zakwe, nivo vili kwa mnt'hu msokezi ukukehitula mwo lusazi lwakwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 26:15" />Mnt'hu msokezi agela mkono wakwe mwe kihungu, mna hakudaha kuuvuza naho mwo mnomo wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 26:16" />Mnt'hu msokezi akeona ni mta mzungu mwe meso yakwe mwenye, kujink'ha want'hu mfungate wakudaha kuhitula kwa mzungu.<verse eid="PRO 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 26:17" />Mnt'hu akukeingiza mwe nk'humbizi hiyo yake ni enga mnt'hu akutoza magutwi ya kuli dina maya.<verse eid="PRO 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 26:18" />Enga mnt'hu mkilalu akusezigila ndilija zo moto hegu misale ye file.<verse eid="PRO 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 26:19" />Nivo vili mnt'hu akumdant'hiliza myawe niyo agamba, “Nehatanila du!”<verse eid="PRO 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 26:20" />Heheina nk'huni moto haukudaha kukwela, haheina msongezi nk'humbizi yasila.<verse eid="PRO 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 26:21" />Enga ivo zili nk'hala hegu nk'huni zikukwela niyo zanda moto, nivo eli mnt'hu mta nk'humbizi akuungisa nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 26:22" />Mbuli ya mnt'hu msongezi ni enga nk'hande imwile, ikwiingilisa mndani mwe zinda za mnt'hu.<verse eid="PRO 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 26:23" />Enga vyombo va ulongo vikulugwe, nivo ili milomo mihufu na milosi ina mwiiile yakukawiila wiihi.<verse eid="PRO 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 26:24" />Mta maya afisa maya yakwe kwa milosi yedi, mna ana nyambi kwo moyo wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 26:25" />Analonga vedi usekumhuwila, kwaviya mwo moyo wakwe kuna uwihi utendese.<verse eid="PRO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 26:26" />Vadahika akafisa uwihi wakwe kwa udant'hi mna nyendo zakwe ziihile nezimanyike kwa wose.<verse eid="PRO 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 26:27" />Akumsimbila miyawe bome nengile mwenye, akuditongolosa iwe nedimuuiye mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 26:28" />Akulonga udant'hi awaihiza wadya akuwalumiza, akukehembeleza naye egala ubanagi.<verse eid="PRO 26:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PRO 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 27:1" />Usekukeduvya kwajili ya luvi, kwaviya hukumanya kikuunga kilaile dyelo.<verse eid="PRO 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 27:2" />Waleke want'hu watuhu wakutogole, kujink'ha mnomo wako weye mwenye, mna mta kwiza naakutogole, mna weye usekukeduvya.<verse eid="PRO 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 27:3" />Iwe dizama, msanga nawo ni nt'wika, mna kugeligwa maya na mhezi kuzama kujink'ha ivo vose viidi.<verse eid="PRO 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 27:4" />Maya yalumiza naho yamola, mna niani akudaha kufinyiliza wivu?<verse eid="PRO 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 27:5" />Ni vedi mnt'hu akukanye pwilili, kujink'ha lukunde lwa kinyele.<verse eid="PRO 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 27:6" />Kulumizwa ni mbuyayo ni uhuwilwa, mna kilagiso cha lukunde kulawa kwa mnk'hondo ni udant'hi.<verse eid="PRO 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 27:7" />Yehe egute hata uki alemela kudya, mna kwa mta sala hata adye kint'hu kisungu kwake ni kimwile.<verse eid="PRO 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 27:8" />Mnt'hu akwangadika hale na kwakwe ni enga dege dilekile hale chaila chakwe.<verse eid="PRO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 27:9" />Mavuta na mhep'he wedi na ubani yegala kinyemi mwo moyo, ni enga mwile ukulawa mwo ulangilizi wa kindedi.<verse eid="PRO 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 27:10" />Usekuwajala mbuyazo hegu wambuyaye ya iso, unapata makunt'ho usekugulukila kwa nduguyo, ni vedi kwa mbuyayo ehagihi kujink'ha nduguyo ehale.<verse eid="PRO 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 27:11" />Mwanangu unde na mzungu vileke nipate kinyemi mwo moyo wangu, name heniswese dya kuhitula kwa yeyose akunibela.<verse eid="PRO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 27:12" />Mta mzungu ayaona yaihile na kukefisa, mna mhezi agendeela hameso na kulumila.<verse eid="PRO 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 27:13" />Mnt'hu analaganila hako kumkimaila mta kwiza, guha suke yakwe, naho guha kint'hu kwa akumkimaila mta kwiza.<verse eid="PRO 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 27:14" />Mnt'hu akumvikila mbuyaye kwa izwi kulu kilokilo, neimanyike kugamba aunga amligite.<verse eid="PRO 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 27:15" />Mvele mta nk'humbizi ni enga matwent'we ye fula heyekusila, <verse eid="PRO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 27:16" />kumkindila yehe ni enga kuikindila mp'heho hegu kutoza mavuta ya mazi mwe kifumba cha mkono.<verse eid="PRO 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 27:17" />Kilama chanola kilama, iviya iviya mnt'hu ahinizwa ni miyawe.<verse eid="PRO 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 27:18" />Yehe akwamila mti naadye matunda yakwe, na akumdamanyila ndima mkulu ywakwe neink'higwe nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PRO 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 27:19" />Enga kihanga ivo kikuoneka mwa mazi, nivo vili moyo wa mnt'hu ukumlagisa ivo eli.<verse eid="PRO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 27:20" />Komnyongomela na ubanangi havikwiguta, iviya iviya na meso ya want'hu hayakwiguta.<verse eid="PRO 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 27:21" />Uwedi wa masawa hegu zahabu vahimwa no moto, mnt'hu naye ahimwa viligane ne zint'hogola zakwe.<verse eid="PRO 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 27:22" />Hata una mtwanga mhezi mwe dituli, naho hata una mtwanga na mtoho enga uhule, hohause uhezi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 27:23" />Dima vedi mifugwa yako, kaulisa ludimo lwako, <verse eid="PRO 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 27:24" />kwaviya ugoli hakwikala ulo na ulo, naho nt'hunyo haikwikala vyeleko vose. <verse eid="PRO 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 27:25" />Kant'ha mani yanyaile uku mani mahya yakasuka, na mani kulawa mwo mnima yaduganywa, <verse eid="PRO 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 27:26" />ngoto nawakwink'he sufu kwajili ya mavalo, noutage mbuzi na kukeguila nk'honde. <verse eid="PRO 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 27:27" />Noupate mele kulawa mwe zimbuzi ikukint'ha weye hamwenga ne mp'huga yako, na kwajili ya wandima wako wa kivele.<verse eid="PRO 27:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PRO 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 28:1" />Waihi waguluka haheina kuguluswa na mnt'hu yeyose, mna wahuwila watoga enga simba.<verse eid="PRO 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 28:2" />Umwo isi inanda na nk'humbizi yanda na vilongozi wengi, mna kwa mta umanyi no ubala isi yanda hedi.<verse eid="PRO 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 28:3" />Mnt'hu mkiwa akumhujila atendese ukiwa, uyo ni enga fula nk'hulu ikubananga ulozo.<verse eid="PRO 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 28:4" />Want'hu hewekutimila sigilizi wawatogola waihi, mna wakutimila sigilizi wahigana nawo.<verse eid="PRO 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 28:5" />Want'hu waihi hawakumanya uwagilwa, mna wadya wakumzungula Zumbe Mnungu wakimanyisa kindedi.<verse eid="PRO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 28:6" />Ni vedi mkiwa akwikala kwa uhuwilwa, kujink'ha mgoli akwikala kwa kusaguka.<verse eid="PRO 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 28:7" />Mwana akutoza sigilizi ni mta mzungu, mna mbuya mhank'hu amgela soni ise.<verse eid="PRO 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 28:8" />Akukegenyezela ugoli kwa liba nk'hulu na kugenyezela upati, ugoli wakwe no wiite kwa mtuhu mta mbazi kwa wakiwa.<verse eid="PRO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 28:9" />Akulemela kutegeleza miko, uyo hata kulombeza kwakwe kwamwihiya Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 28:10" />Akumlangiliza mnt'hu ywedi adamanye yaihile, naagwe mwe dibome dyakwe mwenye, mna heweina masa waikilwa ayedi.<verse eid="PRO 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 28:11" />Mnt'hu mgoli akeona mwenye ana mzungu ha meso hakwe mwenye, mna mnt'hu mkiwa mta umanyi naaike pwilili mbuli za uyo mgoli.<verse eid="PRO 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 28:12" />Want'hu wedi wakanda na upati kwanda na kinyemi kikulu, mna waihi wakalongoza want'hu wakefisa.<verse eid="PRO 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 28:13" />Akufisa wavu wakwe hapate chochose, mna yehe akweiila na kuleka wavu wakwe naaonelwe mbazi.<verse eid="PRO 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 28:14" />Kavikilwa mnt'hu uyo mazuwa yose akumvika Zumbe Mnungu mna yehe akuutenda moyo wakwe kunda mdala naagwe mwe makunt'ho.<verse eid="PRO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 28:15" />Kilongozi mwavu akulongoza wakiwa, ni enga simba ikubuma hegu kala dikukump'hukila.<verse eid="PRO 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 28:16" />Akulongoza vihile hana ubala, mna yudya akuihiwa ni upati wa soni naande na kinyemi mwo wikazi wakwe naho neekalise.<verse eid="PRO 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 28:17" />Mnt'hu akuzamilwa na masa ya kukoma mnt'hu, naande akangadika mpaka abanika, naho mnt'hu yeyose asekumwambiza.<verse eid="PRO 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 28:18" />Akwikala kwa uhuwilwa naayokolwe, mna mdant'hi naabanangwe pele.<verse eid="PRO 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 28:19" />Akulima nk'honde yakwe naapate nk'hande nyingi, mna akutimila mbuli za kihezi naande mkiwa.<verse eid="PRO 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 28:20" />Mnt'hu mhuwilwa naavikiliswe, mna yehe akuungisa ugoli kwa kipump'ha naasulumizwe.<verse eid="PRO 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 28:21" />Hiyo vedi kuzagula mnt'hu, want'hu wadamanya yaihile hata kwajili ya kibesu ka mkate.<verse eid="PRO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 28:22" />Mnt'hu mdala aungisa kugulukila ugoli, naho hakumanya kugamba ukiwa wamwizila. <verse eid="PRO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 28:23" />Akumkanya miyawe uyo naapate ayedi, kujink'ha yudya akumtogola kwa lulimi lwakwe.<verse eid="PRO 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 28:24" />Akuwabaila walesi wakwe, niyo agamba hiyo masa, uyo ni mbuya ywa wabanangi.<verse eid="PRO 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 28:25" />Mgila asongeza nk'humbizi, mna yudya akumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu naapate ayedi.<verse eid="PRO 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 28:26" />Yehe akukehuwila mwenye ni mhezi, mna akwikala kwa mzungu haadugane na maihi.<verse eid="PRO 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 28:27" />Yehe akuwapangila wakiwa hakuhungukilwa ni kint'hu chochose, mna yehe akulemela kuwakaula heweena kint'hu naaligitwe.<verse eid="PRO 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 28:28" />Waihi wakalongoza want'hu wakefisa, mna wakabanika, want'hu wedi wongezekela.<verse eid="PRO 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PRO 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 29:1" />Mnt'hu akugendeela kunda na moyo mdala umwo anenk'higwa maonyo mengi, naavunike naho haahone.<verse eid="PRO 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 29:2" />Wata uwagilwa wanapata upati, want'hu wanda na kinyemi, mna waihi wanalongoza, want'hu wakefisa.<verse eid="PRO 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 29:3" />Mnt'hu akuungisa mzungu amgela ise kinyemi, mna akunda hamwenga na pamp'he, aza ugoli wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 29:4" />Seuta ananda muwagilwa isi yanda itoga, mna seuta mta kumunk'hilwa ni matundu ya soni naaibanange isi.<verse eid="PRO 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 29:5" />Yeyose akukehamp'hikiza kwa miyawe, akeikila mtego wa kukegwiila mwenye.<verse eid="PRO 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 29:6" />Mnt'hu mwihi akegwila kwa kudamanya wavu wakwe mwenye, mna mnt'hu mhuwilwa akema na kunda na kinyemi.<verse eid="PRO 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 29:7" />Mhuwilwa amanya uwagilwa wa wakiwa, mna mnt'hu mwihi hakumanya mbuli izo.<verse eid="PRO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 29:8" />Wata utani waungisa nk'humbizi mwo mzi, mna want'hu wata mzungu wahoza maya.<verse eid="PRO 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 29:9" />Mta mzungu anaita mwe kitala na mhezi, mhezi anda na maya na kubela naho hahana utondowazi.<verse eid="PRO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 29:10" />Wakuungisa kwitila sakame wamwihiya mnt'hu haheina lema, mna want'hu wedi wamila wikazi wawe.<verse eid="PRO 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 29:11" />Mhezi alagisa maya yakwe pwilili, mna mta mzungu egala utondowazi.<verse eid="PRO 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 29:12" />Uneva kilongozi anategeleza mbuli zo udant'hi, wakulu we hasi yakwe wose nawande waihi.<verse eid="PRO 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 29:13" />Mkiwa na mnt'hu hekwink'hiza uwagilwa kwa wantu waligana kwa mbuli imwenga, Zumbe Mnungu awagela ung'azi meso yawe wose waidi.<verse eid="PRO 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 29:14" />Seuta akuwalamula wakiwa kwa uwagilwa, naauone ulongozi wakwe utoga mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PRO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 29:15" />Makanyo ya kufyalika vagela mzungu, mna mwana akulekelwa adamanye ivo akuunga amgela soni nine.<verse eid="PRO 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 29:16" />Waihi wanalongoza, wihi wongezekela, mna wahuwilwa nawaone ukugwa kwa waihi.<verse eid="PRO 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 29:17" />Mkanye mwanao naye naakwink'he nt'hunyo, nounde ne kinyemi mwo moyo wako.<verse eid="PRO 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 29:18" />Haheina maona, want'hu waga mna kavikilwa mnt'hu yudya akuitimila sigilizi.<verse eid="PRO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 29:19" />Mtumwa hakukanywa kwa milosi du, kwaviya hamwenga na kugamba kamanya mna yehe hakutimila.<verse eid="PRO 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 29:20" />Togola wamwona mnt'hu akulongesa haheina kufanyanya? Ni vedi kumhuwila mhezi kujink'ha yehe.<verse eid="PRO 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 29:21" />Akumhembeleza mtumwa wakwe kukongela mwo udodo, mwo uheelo mtumwa uyo eza kumgela nk'huswank'huswa kulongole.<verse eid="PRO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 29:22" />Mnt'hu mta maya aungisa nk'humbizi, mnt'hu mta maya yatendese naye adamanyisa wavu.<verse eid="PRO 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 29:23" />Mta moyo mdala naaselezwe, mna mta moyo wa kukeseleza naapate nt'hogola.<verse eid="PRO 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 29:24" />Akukelunganya na mbavi ni mnk'hondo wa moyo wakwe mwenye, eva ligito dya aonelwe hahena kulonga mbuli.<verse eid="PRO 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 29:25" />Kuwogoha want'hu ni kuketegela mwenye, mna yeyose akumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu naande hant'hu hedi.<verse eid="PRO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 29:26" />Want'hu wengi waungisa kukehembeleza kwa vilongozi, mna mnt'hu apata uwagilwa kulawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 29:27" />Mnt'hu mta nyambi ni ihizo kwa wata uwagilwa, naye mhuwila ni ihizo kwa waihi.<verse eid="PRO 29:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PRO 30" />
  <para style="s">Milosi ya Aguli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 30:1" />Milosi ya Aguli mwanawe Yake. Ulosi uwo wa mnt'hu uyu amgambilaga Itieli na Ukali.<verse eid="PRO 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 30:2" />Miye ni mhezi kujink'ha want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:2">hina umanyi wa kimnt'hu.<verse eid="PRO 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 30:3" />Hikehinize mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:3">naho hina umanyi mwa mbuli za Mnungu uyo Akukile.<verse eid="PRO 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 30:4" />Ni ani akweile kwe mbingu na kuseela? Niani atozile mp'heho mwo mkono?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Ni ani akuyazinganiza mazi mwe suke yakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Ni ani aikile mihaka yose mwe isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Zina dyakwe niye ani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Zina dya mwanawe we kilume etangwa ani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Nigambileni uneva mum manya!<verse eid="PRO 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 30:5" />Kila mbuli ya Mnungu ni ya kindedi, yehe ni nk'hindo kwa wose wakumgulukila. <verse eid="PRO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 30:6" />Usekongezela mbuli zako mwe zimbuli zakwe, sema akakukanya nawe niyo wanda mdant'hi.<verse eid="PRO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngelo nt'huhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 30:7" />Nakulombeza vint'hu viidi weye Zumbe Mnungu, usekuleka kunink'ha umwo handa nikei kubanika. <verse eid="PRO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 30:8" />Uhause lulimi na udant'hi, usekunink'ha ukiwa hegu ugoli, unink'he nk'hande ya kukint'ha kila zuwa, <verse eid="PRO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 30:9" />sema heguta niyo nakulemela, niyo nagamba, Zumbe Mnungu niye ani? Hegu sema handa mkiwa niyo nabawa, na kudihomala dizina dyako weye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PRO 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 30:10" />Usekumsongeza mndima kwa mkulu ywakwe, sema akakuligita na kuoneka na masa.<verse eid="PRO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 30:11" />Weyuko want'hu awo wakuwaligita tate zawe, naho hawakuwavikila mami zawe.<verse eid="PRO 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 30:12" />Weyuko want'hu wakukeona kunda ni wedi, mna wakei kukesunt'ha usavu wawe.<verse eid="PRO 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 30:13" />Weyuko watuhu wana wefenyi, wabela kila kint'hu icho wakuona.<verse eid="PRO 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 30:14" />Weyuko want'hu meno yawe ni enga sime naho magego yawe ni enga ngola. Wakeika lumwe kuwadya wakiwa wa mwe isi, na wadya haweina kint'hu kulawa mwa want'hu .<verse eid="PRO 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 30:15" />Mnyula ananawo wanakike waidi wakuila, watendigwe “Nink'he!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:15">Kuna vint'hu vitatu hevikwiguta, naho viyuko vine hevikugamba Ikint'ha.<verse eid="PRO 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 30:16" />kikuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">nda ya mvele heikweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">isi heikwiguta mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">na moto houkugamba, higuta.<verse eid="PRO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 30:17" />Uneva mnt'hu anambela ise, na kumbela nine, kungulu dya kwe dikolongo nedimnonole meso yakwe niyo dyadigwa ne degenyika.<verse eid="PRO 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 30:18" />Kuna mbuli nt'hatu kwangu zo kwehela, naho mbuli nne hikuzimanya.<verse eid="PRO 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 30:19" />Lugendo lwa mwewe ko ulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">lugendo lwa zoka mwo luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">lugendo lwa meli mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">na icho kikuwabwedeza mgosi na mvele.<verse eid="PRO 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 30:20" />Lugendo lwa mvele mhabwasi ni uno, Yehe adya nk'hande niyo akesunt'ha mnomo wakwe, niyo agamba “Hidamanye masa yoyose!”<verse eid="PRO 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 30:21" />Kuna mbuli nt'hatu zinalaila isi yazingiza, naho kwa mbuli nne haikudaha kufinyiliza.<verse eid="PRO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 30:22" />Mtumwa ananda seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:22">Mhezi akint'hize kila kint'hu icho akuunga ukudya.<verse eid="PRO 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 30:23" />Mvele hekuungwa kulombigwa akeza kulombigwa, mndima ywa kivele akuguha hant'hu ha mvele mta inyumba.<verse eid="PRO 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 30:24" />Kuna viumbwa vine vidodo vitendese mwe isi, mna vina ubala utendese.<verse eid="PRO 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 30:25" />Mswa ni viumbwa heviina ludole, mna wakeikila nk'hande mwo lupisi lwa zuwa.<verse eid="PRO 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 30:26" />Mp'helele ni viumbwa heviina udahi, mna vakedamanyila nyumba zawe mwe zinyuwe.<verse eid="PRO 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 30:27" />Sige hazina seuta, mna zose zagenda hamwenga mwa matuluma.<verse eid="PRO 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 30:28" />Gondo dyadaha kugwiligwa ne mikono, mna wadaha kudiona mwe zinyumba ze kiseuta.<verse eid="PRO 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 30:29" />Kuna viumbwa vitatu vikwelela vikagenda, naho hana viumbwa vine vikugenda kwa wefenyi.<verse eid="PRO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 30:30" />Simba ni kala dina ludole kujink'ha makala yose, naho hadikogoha kala dyodyose.<verse eid="PRO 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 30:31" />Zogolo dikugenda kwa kukeduvya na vulata, na seuta ha want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 30:32" />Uneva kudamanya uhezi niyo waketogola mwenye, hegu uneva kukeika lumwe kudamanya yaihile, unyamale. <verse eid="PRO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 30:33" />Kwaviya enga viya kukuchulisa mele wapata mabongo, naho unamtowa mnt'hu mwe zip'hula naalawe sakame, iviya iviya unanda na maya kwalaila nk'humbizi.<verse eid="PRO 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PRO 31" />
  <para style="s">Ulangilizi wa Lemueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 31:1" />Ulangilizi wa seuta Lemueli, makanyo ahinizwe na nine: <verse eid="PRO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 31:2" />Hugambilei mwanangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:2">Hugambilei mwanangu hweleke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:2">Hugambilei weye hulombeze kulawa kwa Mnungu? <verse eid="PRO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 31:3" />Usekubinda ludole lwako kwa wavele, usekuwenk'ha ugoli wako awo wakubananga maseuta. <verse eid="PRO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 31:4" />Havikuwagile weye Lemueli, haikuwagila maseuta waungise divai, wakulu nawo waungise mp'hombe, <verse eid="PRO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 31:5" />sema wanakolwe niyo wajala miko iyo wenk'higwe, na kuleka kuwenk'ha uwagilwa wawe wata makunt'ho. <verse eid="PRO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 31:6" />Wenk'he mp'hombe wadya we mwe kubanika, wenk'he divai wadya wata sungusungu mwe mioyo, <verse eid="PRO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 31:7" />wainywe na kujala ukiwa wawe, wasekukumbukila makunt'ho yawe.<verse eid="PRO 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 31:8" />Walongele wose, kwajili ya uwagilwa wa wose hewekudaha kukelongela wenye. Ugombele uwagilwa wa wadya heweina wambizi. <verse eid="PRO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 31:9" />Longa kwajili yawe na kulamula kwa uwagilwa, uwenk'he wakiwa na wadya wakuunga kwambizwa uwagilwa wawe.<verse eid="PRO 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvele ywedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 31:10" />Mvele mta nt'hogola yedi ni ani akudaha kumpata? Yehe ni ywa yombe kulu kujink'ha iwe dya yombe kulu.<verse eid="PRO 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 31:11" />Mgosiwe amhuwilisa, naho hakuswesa kint'hu chochose cha yombe kulu.<verse eid="PRO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 31:12" />Amdamanyila mgosiwe yedi naho hiyo yaihile, mazuwa yose mwo wikazi wakwe.<verse eid="PRO 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 31:13" />Azunguila sufu na kitambala king'aile, naho adamanya ndima kwa mikono yakwe kwa kukombatiza.<verse eid="PRO 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 31:14" />Yehe ni enga meli za uchuuzi, aleta nk'hande yakwe kulawa hale.<verse eid="PRO 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 31:15" />Yehe akelauka kwinuka, naho awenk'ha mp'huga yakwe nk'hande na kuwapangila ndima wandima wakwe wa kivele.<verse eid="PRO 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 31:16" />Aikaula nk'honde na kuigula, viigane na icho akupata, ahanda mizabibu mwe nk'honde yakwe.<verse eid="PRO 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 31:17" />Adamanya ndima zakwe kwa ludole, mikono yakwe ina ludole kwajili ya ndima zakwe.<verse eid="PRO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 31:18" />Kamanya kugamba ndima zakwe zamwink'ha upati, adamanya ndima hata nekilo.<verse eid="PRO 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 31:19" />Aluka nyuzi kwa mikono yakwe mwenye, kwa madole yakwe mwenye afuma suke.<verse eid="PRO 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 31:20" />Agubula vifumba vakwe kwa wakiwa, achulula mikono yakwe awambize heweeina kint'hu.<verse eid="PRO 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 31:21" />Want'hu we mp'huga yakwe hawakogoha kukanda kwalosa, kwaviya kila yumwenga ananazo suke za kukebwikaniza.<verse eid="PRO 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 31:22" />Akedamanyila vigonelo mwo lusazi lwakwe, mavalo yakwe ni ya langi ya zambalau na kitambala king'aile.<verse eid="PRO 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 31:23" />Mgosiwe kamanyika vedi, ni yumwenga mwa walamuzi wadala vilongozi we isi.<verse eid="PRO 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 31:24" />Mvele uyo adamanya suke na kuzitaga, naye awatagila wachuuzi wa misipi.<verse eid="PRO 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 31:25" />Kenk'higwa ludole na nt'hogola, adaha kuseka haheina kogoha kwa mazuwa yakwiza.<verse eid="PRO 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 31:26" />Agubula mnomo wakwe na kulonga kwa mzungu, icho akulonga ni mahinizo ya kuhuwilwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 31:27" />Akaula kwa wengele mbuli zose zikudamanyika mwe nyumba yakwe, naho hana usokezi.<verse eid="PRO 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 31:28" />Wanawe wenuka na kumwitanga mvikilwa, mgosiwe naye amtogola.<verse eid="PRO 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 31:29" />Agamba, Wavele wengi wadamanya mbuli zo kwehela, mna weye kuwajink'ha wose.<verse eid="PRO 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 31:30" />Kukehamba vileke want'hu wakuungise ni kukedant'ha, utana wasunguza komboka, mna mvele akumvika Zumbe Mnungu naatogolwe.<verse eid="PRO 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 31:31" />Mwink'he geleko viligane na ivo adamanye, ndima zakwe zaungigwa zitogolwe hant'hu hohose.<verse eid="PRO 31:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 31" />
</usx>